2 CONT Death:  10-20-1775     WEST HARTFORD HARTFORD CO CONNECTICUT
2 CONT Service Source:  BATES, ROLLS & LISTS OF CT MEN IN THE REV, VOL 8, P 16; JOHNSTON, CT MEN IN THE REV, P 13
2 CONT Service Description:  1) CAPT ABRAHAM SEDGWICK'S CO, HINMAN'S REGT
