2 CONT
2 CONT Graduated from Yale College in 1835, and then from Andover Theological Seminary in 1838. He was ordained as a missionary in Woburn, Middlesex County, Massachusetts in November 30, 1838. He was for some time a missionary in Jerusal
2 CONC em, Palestine before settling in Manchester, Hartford County, Connecticut.
