2 CONT ****      FARNSWORTH, Joseph 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sarah WADSWORTH''' was 
2 CONT * born 1626 in Braintree, Essex, England. 
2 CONT * She died 1649 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut. 
2 CONT * Sarah married John WILCOX on 17 Sep 1646 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut.  
2 CONT * John Wilcox, died May 24, 1676 in Middletown CT. 
2 CONT * He married '''2107'''. Sarah Wadsworth September 17, 1646.  ('''2107''' = Sarah Wadsworth)
2 CONT
