2 CONT
2 CONT '''Esther CORNWALL''' 1, 2 [4th wife]
2 CONT * was born May 1650 in Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut. 
2 CONT * She died 2 May 1733 in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut. 
2 CONT * Esther married John WILCOX on 1671 in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut.
2 CONT * Other marriages:
2 CONT ** STOWE, John  '''Sources:'''
