2 CONC church  there in 1668. His will, dated July 3, 1722, mentions wife  Rebecca, sons Samuel and Ebenezer, daughters Rebecca, Eliza-  beth and Mary, and granddaughters Jemima and Lois, daugh-  ters of his son William, deceased. His es
2 CONC tate amounted to  £251. Children born in Middletown, Conn. 
