2 CONT Col Hiram Phelps BIRTH	1798 Massachusetts, USA DEATH	28 Jun 1862 (aged 63–64) Davie County, North Carolina, USA BURIAL	 Advance United Methodist Church Cemetery Advance, Davie County, North Carolina, USA MEMORIAL ID	26462655 · Vie
