2 CONT
2 CONT Frederick Phelps and Bethia Stowe were married on Aug. 25, 1798 in Marlborough, Conn. Their children were: 1. Lucy Phelps b. April 5, 1799, d. May 9, 1799 2. David Phelps b. May 25, 1800; m (1) Mary Dickinson & (2) Laura Ingham Be
2 CONC ardsley. They lived in Williamstown, Michigan 3. Erastus Phelps b. July 5, 1802, d. April 27, 1806 4. Lucy Phelps b. March 13, 1804 in Marlborough, CT 5. Erastus Phelps (Twin to Augustus) b. Aug. 18, 1805 6. Augustus Phelps (Twin 
2 CONC to Erastus) b. June 11, 1806; m Julia Skinner on Dec. 15, 1831 7. Epaphras Phelps b. Sept.16, 1808, d. Feb 16, 1844 8. Sophia Phelps. March 17, 1811, d. March 21, 1861. Unmarried 9. William Phelps b. Dec. 22 1812, d. Nov. 27, 1865
2 CONC ; m. (1) Martha Smith on Sept 9, 1844 in Hebron, CT. & (2) Elizabeth Emmons on Oct. 25, 1850 in Marlborough, CT.
