1 NOTE Dedham, Medfield. A husbandman from New Bucknam, England. Left England soon after April 12, 1637, and came to Dedham. Became a proprietor on 28 Nov, 1637, church member 22 Sept. 1639, freeman 13 May 1640. Among the first settlers 
2 CONC in Medfield in 1651. His house lot was on South Street. Selectman for 13 years.
