2 CONT # https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Phineas_Wilson_%281%29
2 CONT ## Phineas Wilson of Hartford, in Stevens, Ken. Five Families from Hartford County, Connecticut. (Walpole, New Hampshire: Ken Stevens, 1989) 191-93. Phineas Wilson, born probably in Yorkshire, England about 1628 (calculated), died
2 CONC  at Hartford, CT 22 May 1692 ae. about 64. … The will of Phineas Wilson dated 6 May 1692 [Manwaring's abstract says 1691] was proven at Hartford [Manwaring's abstract says in was proved in Boston on that date] on 11 July 1692
2 CONT ## Willson, Phineas, Hartford, in Manwaring, Charles W. A Digest of the Early Connecticut Probate Records. (Hartford, Conn.: R. S. Peck & Co., 1904-06) 1:522-24.
