1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Warren, called tobacconist and cardmaker, was an early settler of Exeter, NH, moved to Boston 1668 where he died in July 1677. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married first, at Exeter, 21 Oct. 1650, Deborah Wilson (died 26 June 1668). 
2 CONT
2 CONT John Warren married second, at Boston about 1669, Elizabeth (?Royal) (Barlo w) Coombs, widow of John Coombs (died May 1668.)
2 CONT
2 CONT He married third Elizabeth Danson 
2 CONT
2 CONT See [TAG 46:132 & TAG 47:17].
2 CONT
