2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Deborah Wilson was born 21 Aug 1634 Roxbury, Suffolk Co., MA.[1] She died 26 Jul 1668 Exeter, Rockingham Co., NH.[2]Deborah married John Warren 21 Oct 1650 Exeter, Rockingham Co., NH.[3][2]
