2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Barlow in the New England, The Great Migration and The Great Migration Begins, 1620-1635 < [https://www.ancestry.com/sharing/17084914?mark=7b22746f6b656e223a2239765a727250526b4b653767496e363661455a7233616966474e517251354238
2 CONC 504167597666594f5330633d222c22746f6b656e5f76657273696f6e223a225632227d AncestrySharing] >
2 CONT
2 CONT John Coombs, b. say 1633; m. Boston 24 February 1661/2 Elizabeth Barlow [BVR 82]; she was widow of Thomas Barlow.  (For a detailed discussion of the life of John Coombs and the marital career of his wife, see TAG 46:129-34.)
2 CONT
