2 CONT WHITING, ELISHA  Dar Ancestor #: A211304
2 CONT Service:  CONNECTICUT    Rank(s): PRIVATE
2 CONT Birth:  BAPTISED 11-21-1762    WEST DIVISION PAR HARTFORD CO CONNECTICUT
2 CONT Death:  POST 2-14-1792     WEST DIVISION PAR HARTFORD CO CONNECTICUT
2 CONT Service Source:  NARA, M881, COMP MIL SERV RECS, ROLL #367; NARA, M246, REV WAR ROLLS 1775-1783, ROLL #26
2 CONT Service Description:  1) CAPT OZIAS BISSELL, COL ROGER ENOS
