1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Henry Roger Sherman, Jr.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/143717943/henry-roger-sherman Find A Grave Memorial ID # 143717943]
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry Roger Sherman Jr was born on August 18, 1864 in Washington DC, the son of Henry Roger Sherman Sr (born in Albany, New York) and Anna (Burnaham) Sherman (born in New York City).
2 CONT
2 CONT Retired from insurance and living on Blackburn Drive, Belle Meade, Tennessee, he was 76 years old and a widower when he died of uremia at 1415 17th Avenue South, Nashville on March 13, 1941. His body was removed the next day for b
2 CONC urial in Spring Grove Cemetery at Hartford, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT The above is from his Death Certificate, with Mrs Ray H. Gustetter (daughter) of Nashville as the informant.
2 CONT
