1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jonathan Waid (John4 Wade, John3, Nicholas2, Thomas1) was born
2 CONT February 15, 1720/21 in Lyme, New London Co., CT, and died April 1792 in
2 CONT Lyme, New London Co., CT. He married Hannah Ransom Abt. 1745 in Lyme, New
2 CONT London Co., CT, daughter of Joseph Ransom and Jane.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Jonathan Waid:
2 CONT  He maybe the first of the Nicholas Wade family to spell his name Waid.
2 CONT A deed dated February 14, 1794, Lyme Land Records 20:355, names children of
2 CONT Jonathan and Hannah (-----) WADE,
2 CONT  including son Josiah "of Litchfield."
2 CONT Jonathan was b. February 15, 1720/1, Lyme (Land Records 7:85), son of John
2 CONT and Mercy (PEMBER) WADE. His parents were married January 8, 1706/07, New
2 CONT London (Vital Records 1:33). John was named on June 25, 1722 in the will of
2 CONT his father John WADE, who m.(1) bef. 20 Aug 1691, Elizabeth DURANT, dau. of
2 CONT George.
2 CONT  Jonathan's estate was administered in 1782 [sic 1792?]; the papers
2 CONT name his wife Hannah and his children, all with the surname WAID: Josiah,
2 CONT Mehitable, Timothy H., Increase, Hannah, Nathan L., and Polly.
2 CONT More About Jonathan Waid:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Film number 962428, p. 547, ref. # 11487
2 CONT Comment 1: Lyme Land Records vol. 7:85
2 CONT Comment 2: _Compendium of American Genealogy_
2 CONT Property: Deed, February 14, 1794, Lyme Land Records 20:355
2 CONT More About Hannah Ransom:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Batch 519207, sheet 43
2 CONT Children of Jonathan Waid and Hannah Ransom are:
2 CONT         + 68 i. Josiah6 Waid, born Abt. 1746 in Lyme, New London Co., CT.
2 CONT              69 ii. Timothy H. Waid, born Abt. 1748 in Lyme, New London Co., CT.
2 CONT More About Timothy H. Waid:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Film number 442588; 458873
2 CONT           70 iii. Nathan L. Waid, born Abt. 1752 in Lyme, New London Co., CT. He
2 CONT married Isabel Searle.
2 CONT More About Nathan L. Waid:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Film number 442588; 458873
2 CONT          71 iv. Mehitable Waid, born Abt. 1754 in Lyme, New London Co., CT. She
2 CONT married Selah Strong.
2 CONT More About Mehitable Waid:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Film number 458873; 962431, p. 242, ref. #
2 CONT 5074
2 CONT          72 v. Hannah Waid, born Abt. 1757 in Lyme, New London Co., CT. She married
2 CONT Stephen Searle.
2 CONT More About Hannah Waid:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Film number 458873; 962434 p. 1274, ref. #
2 CONT 26753
2 CONT        + 73 vi. Increase Waid, born 1757 in Lyme, New London Co., CT; died 1832 in
2 CONT Gouverneur, NY.
2 CONT         74 vii. Polly Waid, born Abt. 1761 in Lyme, New London Co., CT. She
2 CONT married Nathan Lawrence.
2 CONT More About Polly Waid:
2 CONT Birth Record: IGI Record - LDS Film number 458873; 962433 p. 1259, ref. #
2 CONT 264
