1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/151074296/hugh-dunn
2 CONT
2 CONT ''''Hugh was Sergt. of Co. militia. Hugh left the Baptist organization in 1705 to
2 CONT
2 CONT start the Seventh-Day Baptist in Piscataway. Also leaving were his brothers
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel & Joseph Dunn. Will proved 16 Feb 1736/7.
2 CONT
2 CONT In New Jersey Archives Vol. XXX(I) p 155 Says Hugh Dunn of Piscataway,
2 CONT
2 CONT Middlesex co., yeoman, 31 Jan 1736/7. Brother, Joseph Dunn. Daughters, Ruth &
2 CONT
2 CONT Rebecca; sons Hugh, Jeremiah, Zachariah, Benjamin, Phineas. Land adjoining
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Woodin. Executors; friends, Joseph FitzRandolph & Edmund Dunham.
2 CONT --------------------
