2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LJ29-WXT/jeremiah-dunn-1712-1794
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jeremiah Dunn was born on 10 December 1712, in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey, United States, his father, Hugh Dunn, was 34 and his mother, Elizabeth Martin, was 32. He married Sarah Hull on 11 March 1733, in New Jersey, B
2 CONC ritish Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 17 May 1794, in his hometown, at the age of 81, and was buried in Saint James Episcopal Church Cemetery, Edison, Middlesex, New Jersey, 
2 CONC United States.
2 CONT
