1 NOTE {geni:about_me} A Patriot of the American Revolution for MASSACHUSETTS with the rank of CAPTAIN.  DAR  Ancestor #: A077778
2 CONT
2 CONT From New England Families, Genealogical and Memorial, Volume 1  edited by William Richard Cutter:
2 CONT > Joseph, first son of Deacon Joseph and Mary Leonard Merrick, was born at West Springfield Massachusetts in 1739.  In the records he is spoken of as Captain Joseph but no particulars are given of the service which entitled him to
2 CONC  this title.  He married Deborah Leonard of West Springfield.  His four sons all born at West Springfield were Gad June 28 1763, Perez,  Joseph May 12 1769,  Quartus March 1771.
2 CONT
2 CONT For his ancestry, see:
2 CONT *[http://www.ebooksread.com/authors-eng/george-byron-1841-1931-from-old-catalog-merrick/genealogy-of-the-merrick--mirick--myrick-family-of-massachusetts-rre/page-28-genealogy-of-the-merrick--mirick--myrick-family-of-massachusetts-
2 CONC rre.shtml Genealogy of the Merrick--Mirick--Myrick family of Massachusetts] 
