1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married (2nd wife of John Warner II) July, 1715, Mrs. SILENCE HAND-WILCOX, born March, 1678-79, or November 12, 1679, probably in Guilford, Conn., died before 1726. She was the daughter of Joseph Hand (son of John 
2 CONC of Easthampton L.I.) who settled in the eastern part of the town of Guilford after 1660 and married in 1664, Jane Wright, daughter of Benjamin Wright. Joseph Hand was a Representative to the General Court in 1720, and seems to hav
2 CONC e been one of the substantial men of the town, serving on various committees.
2 CONT
2 CONT Silence Hand first married, October 23, 1698, Ephraim Wilcox, of Middletown. who died January 4, 1711.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
