2 CONT Sgt. John Cornwall 1640–1707
2 CONT Martha Peck Cornwall 1641–1708
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Samuel Doolittle 1665–1714 m about 1687 Middletown, Connecticut, British Colonial America
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT William Cornwall Sr 1671–1747
2 CONT John Cornwall II 1671–1746
2 CONT Hannah Cornwall Doolittle 1677–1736
2 CONT Capt. Joseph Cornwell 1679–1741
2 CONT Benjamin Cornwell 1688–1754
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 11x b. in Wallingford*, Middletown**
2 CONT *Jonathan Doolittle 8/21/1689–1759
2 CONT *Lieut. Samuel Doolittle Jr 8/31/1691–1736
