2 CONT **Martha Hall 4/6/1698–1779
2 CONT **Hannah Doolittle Turner 10/29/1700–1738 m. Steven Turner
2 CONT **Thankful Doolittle Bacon 6/3/1702–1750 m. John s. of David and Sarah (Rockwell) Hall, b. 9 May 1678
2 CONT **Joseph Doolittle 6/20/1704-
2 CONT **Nathaniel Doolittle 1/15/1706-
