2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/8088537/mary-bacon
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary White (M1)Cornwell (M2)Bacon
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was born 7 April 1659 at Middleton, Middlesex Co., CT, (USA) the 4th daughter of Cptn. Nathaniel White and Elizabeth Bunce/Bounce 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married #1, 16 Jan 1677 to Jacob Cornwell (Son of William Cornwell 1609-1678 & Mary Bailey 1618-1678, daughter of John Bailey and Lydia Backus) Jacob died in 1708.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary and Jacob (all born in Middletown, CT)
2 CONT * Mary B. 3 Nov 1679
2 CONT * Jacob B. 9 Aug 1681, D. 9 Nov 1681
2 CONT * Jacob B. 1 Oct 1682
2 CONT * Nathaniel B. 30 Aug 1684
2 CONT * Giles B. 14 Aug 1686
2 CONT * Daniel B. 19 April 1688
2 CONT * Issac B. 23 Sept 1690
2 CONT * Wait B. 18 Sept 1692
2 CONT * Elizabeth B. 31 July 1697-8
2 CONT * Timothy B. Aug 1700 (note m. Susannah Hamlin)
2 CONT
2 CONT ~Married #2 John Bacon 13 April 1710 Children of Mary and John (?)
2 CONT
2 CONT In my records, John died one day before Mary in November of 1732 at Hartford, Hartford Co, CT (USA). Mary was 73 years of age.
2 CONT
