2 CONT * '''Father of:'''   Benoni Plumbe, John* Plumbe, Samuel Plumbe, Joseph Plumbe, Green Plumbe, Mercy Plumbe, George (2) Plumbe and Sarah Plumbe
2 CONT * '''Died: ''' about 1696 in New London, New London, Connecticut, USA
