1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://books.google.com/books?id=ctEUAAAAYAAJ&printsec=frontcover#v=onepage&q&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT See p 35, Shephard states John Hall of Wallingford b 1605 had no child Richard b 1645. There is a Richard Hall b 1672, d 1725 in Middletown Ct, later New Haven and wife Hannah, buried in Grove St Cemetery New Haven CT. He was the 
2 CONC son of  Cpt John  and Elizabeth (Cornwall) Hall of Middletown CT. Cpt John did buy some land in Wallingford and willed it to his grandson Samuel Hall in a 1711 will.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Families of Ancient New Haven by Donald Lines Jacobus, pg. 717, 1183
