2 CONT * Updated from [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&amp;GRid=72233230 Find A Grave Memorial] via daughter [http://www.geni.com/profile-34669948062 Sarah Elvira  Allred (born Burdick)] by [http://www.geni.com/projects/
