2 CONT ~MY ANCESTOR~ The son of Richard & Jeane Lord of County Towchester, Northampton, England, he married first Dorothy Buckley, daughter of Edward Buckley & sister of Rev. Peter Buckley. After her death, he married Dorothy Bird 23 Feb
2 CONC  1610/1611 in Townschester. Thomas & his second wife came from England in The "Elizabeth and Ann" to Cambridge Mass, 1635; joined Rev. Thomas Hooker's party in founding Hartford, Conn 1636; Thomas was an original proprietor of Har
2 CONC tford, Conn. His name is on the Founder's Monument in the Ancient Cemetery where he is buried.  Thomas & Dorothy (Bird) Lord were the parents of at least nine children all being born in England, one of which (WILLIAM LORD) was my 
2 CONC ancestor.
