1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 1-7369
1 NOTE Event(s)
2 CONT 	Birth:  	1585 	 
2 CONT 		Towchester, Northampton, England, Great Britain 	 
2 CONT 	Christening:  	27 Dec 1618 	 
2 CONT 		, , England 	 
2 CONT 	Death:  	17 May 1678 	 
2 CONT 		., Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut 	 
2 CONT 	Burial:  	23 Feb 1667 	 
2 CONT 		., Hartford, Hartford, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The son of Richard & Jeane Lord of County Townchester, Northampton, England, he married first Dorothy Buckley, daughter of Edward Buckley & sister of Rev. Peter Buckley. After her death, he married Dorothy Bird 23 Feb 1610 in Town
2 CONC schester. Joseph & his second wife came from England in The "Elizabeth and Ann" to Cambridge Mass, 1635; joined Rev. Thomas Hooker's party in founding Hartford, Conn 1636; Thomas was an original proprietor of Hartford, Conn. His n
2 CONC ame is on the Founder's Monument in the Ancient Cemetery where he is buried.
2 CONT Thomas & Dorothy (Bird) Lord were the parents of at least nine children all being born in England,
1 NOTE _STATMARRIED
1 NOTE IMM: (Son of Richard, of Towcester, Co. Northampton, ENG. married Joan), from ENG. in the "Elizabeth and Ann," to Cambridge, MASS., 1635; joined Rev. Thomas Hooker's party in founding of Hartford, CT., 1636; an original propr. of 
2 CONC Hartford.
2 CONT
