1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Margaret Pynchon''' was born about 1624 at Dorchester, Dorset, England. She married at Springfield, on 6 December 1644, Capt. William Davis of Boston, born about 1620 at Dorchester, Dorset, England. She died on 
2 CONC 3 July 1653 at Boston, Suffolk County, Mass. Capt. Davis died 17 May, 1676, at Boston, Suffolk Co., Mass. He was a wealthy and enterprising Boston apothecary, and was chosen deputy from Springfield several times.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of William Davis and Margaret Pynchon are:
2 CONT # Thomas Davis, born September 03, 1645; married Hannah L everett September 12, 1689.
2 CONT #Anna bap 3rd day 7th month 1647; not mentioned in will
2 CONT #Benjamin Davis, born June 17, 1649; died November 26 , 1704 in Boston, Massachusetts; married (1) Sarah Richards ; married (2) Mary Tippet.
2 CONT #Ephraim Davis, born Bef. August 03, 1652 [bap 8th day 3rd month 1651] ; died Augus t 02, 1652 [2nd day 6th month 1652]
2 CONT #William Davis, born Bet. May 03 - June 25, 1653 in Bos ton, Suffolk County, Massachusetts; died 1707, married Abigail Elliot Abt. 1680;
