1 NOTE {geni:about_me} d/o John Allyn / Ann Smith - Granddaughter of Matthew Allyn early settler of Hartford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died on Gardiners Island and is buried there. In 1806, John Lyon Gardiner the Seventh Proprietor of the Island erected a memorial stone over her grave. The date of her death does not appear there. 
2 CONT
2 CONT m [1] 21 Dec 1703/4 Hartford Co., CT Alexander Allen -his 2nd wife 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had 1 child - Fitz John d/o Fitz John - Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT m [2] 13 Jul 1710*  John Gardiner -his 3rd wife -no issue
2 CONT
2 CONT ref: Lion Gardiner, and his Descendants by Curtiss C. Gardiner 1890 -*Note - Either the date of the death of John's 2nd wife 3 Jul 1711, or that of his marriage to his 3rd wife 13 Jul 1710, must be incorrect. Date for the former i
2 CONC s East Hampton Church Records, and the inscription on her headstone -Sarah. The date for the latter is the genealogy of the Allen Family, Chandler Family and Savage's Genealogical Dictionary. 
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/137499671 Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Jan 2 2020, 13:30:14 UTC''
