2 CONC 6-1911; Lincoln, George, 1822-1909; Hersey, Edmund; Burr, Fearing; Seymour, Charles W. S. (Charles Winfield Scott), 1839-1895 (Publication date 1893).  Page  332. < [https://archive.org/details/historyoftownofh0203hing/page/n343/m
2 CONC ode/2up Archive.Org] >
