2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Little Compton, Newport County, Rhode Island (Old Commons Cemetery) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Inscription: "In memory of Capt David Hillard died January ye 11th 1748/9 in the 71st year of his age" 3 4 
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism: 3 MAR 1678 Hingham, Plymouth County, Massachusetts 5 
2 CONT
2 CONT Religion: Admitted to Little Compton United Congregational Church 30 MAY 1717 Little Compton, Newport County, Rhode Island 6 
2 CONT
