2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Hobart married Isaac Peterson 10 Sept 1712 in Hingham, Massachusetts.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was born in Hingham 19 Aug 1686; d. in Duxbury, Massachusetts, 22 March 1763 in her 74th year. She was the daughter of Danield and Elizabeth (Warren) Hobart.[2]
