2 CONT 20 January 1692–Deceased
2 CONT •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Sarah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Sarah Burr was born on 20 January 1692, in Hingham, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, John Burr, was 32 and her mother, Mary Lazell Warren, was 29. She married Elisha Bisbee on 21 February 1712, 
2 CONC in Hingham, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. She lived in Hingham, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States in 1692.
