2 CONT The son of Capt. Medad & Elizabeth (Holton) Webster, he married Huldah Skinner and died at the age of 63 years.  Their children: 1. Infant died April 24, 1787 ae 2 days 2. Child died Nov. 24, 1790 ae 2 yrs. 3. Elizabeth bpt. May 8
2 CONC , 1791, m. Samuel Slater? 4. Mary b. Sept. 1, 1772, m. Phineas Shepard 5. Menzies m. Abigail Bunce  6. Fanny b. March 15, 1792, m. Alvin Stedman 7. Charles bptt. Dec. 6, 1795, died Aug. 8, 1807 ae 13, buried in Maple Ave. Cemetery
2 CONC  (Old South) 8. Patty bpt. Sept. 26, 1802 (Families of Early Hartford, Connecticut, p. 654) 
