2 CONT Inscription
2 CONT Lucinda, wife of William Whiting, died Sept 10, 1838, Aged 67 years & 9 mos, She's gone and no more will return, She's gone and left her friends to mourn, She's gone to join the blest, We trust she's gone to endless rest.
