1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (son of E. Shurtleff and Susan Gorham of Russell Hampden county, Massachusetts, born 1776, at same place). Born May 14, 1814. Came to Utah 1847.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Elizabeth Loomis October 27, 1836, at Russell, Mass, (daughter of Mr. Loomis and Patience Root), who was born March 19, 1816.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Lucy Alvirea S. born January 8, 1838, died;
2 CONT             Emmerson Davis born July 29, 1839, married Mary Ann Trilie;
2 CONT             Harrison Tuttle born January 1, 1841, married Nellie Smith 1863;
2 CONT             Hyrum Chester born November 29, 1845, married Ellen Cressmon 1867;
2 CONT             Buson born April 15, 1847, died;
2 CONT             Albert Dewey born May 25, 1849, married Ofidia Stoddard April 11, 1872;
2 CONT             Mary Elizabeth born December 18, 1851, died;
2 CONT             Laura Celistia born August 25, 1855, married Gilbert Webb Jr. October 16, 1874;
2 CONT             Vincent Haswell born September 2, 1859, married Elizabeth Cory Hickerson August 10, 1890.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Mary Hadlock Brockway October 22, 1847, Salt Lake City, who was born November 2, 1821, Waterford, Caledonia county, Vermont.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Lyman Elisha born September 2, 1848, died January 20, 1883;
2 CONT             Luther Gorham born December 11, 1849, died November 10, 1850;
2 CONT             Martha Maria born April 2, 1852, married Melvin Miller February 12, 1872;
2 CONT             Brigham Young born October 2, 1854, married Mary Augusta Clinton November 20, 1877;
2 CONT             Vincent born August 20, 1857, married Sarah E. Brinton January 17, 1881;
2 CONT             Mary Emma born June 19, 1860, died October 12, 1865;
2 CONT             George Washington born April 6, 1862, married Alice Elvira Cook July 3, 1888.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Married:	Elizabeth Tophan December 4, 1850, Salt Lake City (daughter of John Tophan and Jane Tophan, latter pioneer 1848, Bishop Evans company). She was born June 10, 1833, Eden Saken, Bedfordshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Sarah Jane born November 23, 1851, married Charles A. Smih December 25, 1874;
2 CONT             Emily born February 27, 1856, married Philip Goffney;
2 CONT             Heber Rimbek born August 6, 1854, died;
2 CONT             Frank born April 19, 1858, died;
2 CONT             Eliza Alvira born March 3, 1860, died;
2 CONT             John Topham born December 26, 1861, died;
2 CONT             Harrold Bexter born December 8, 1862, died;
2 CONT             Hannah born October 2, 1864, married William Johnston September 11, 1893;
2 CONT             William born December 3, 1866, married Annie Williams April 12, 1889;
2 CONT             John born August 1869, died February 10, 1875.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Family home Mill Creek, Salt Lake county.
2 CONT     Married:	Lydia Amanda Shurtliff December 9, 1854, Salt Lake City (daughter of Luman Shurtliff), who was born August 1, 1838, Far West, Caldwell county, Missouri.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Louis Vincent born July 23, 1857, married Alice Harriet Casto January 29, 1881;
2 CONT             Haskell born February 18, 1862, died November 23, 1864;
2 CONT             Charles H. born December 30, 1868, married Florence Odekirk December 13, 1893.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Family home Salt Lake City.
2 CONT
2 CONT Missionary to England 1851. School trustee in Mill Creek; helped to build first adobe school houses. Farmer and stockraiser. Sources:	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah photographs, page 123
2 CONT     Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, page 1160
