1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Rev. Lauren Armsby'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/42453582/lauren-armsby Find A Grave Memorial ID # 42453582]
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Amos & Margaret Fletcher Armsby. Graduate of Amherst College of 1842 and served in the Congregational Church. Married on 3 May 1846 to Hannah Van Ingen and they had one child, Sherman Armsby. She died in 1848. He then marri
2 CONC ed Eliza Lee Hale and they were the parents of Clarence, Alice and Henrietta. He was known as the "grand old man" and during his thirty-one year's residence in Council Grove, christenings, marriages, funerals and public gatherings
2 CONC  were incomplete without his services or ministrations. Served as Chaplain of the Eighth Minnesota volunteer regiment during the Civil War.
