2 CONC  Natural : Child:  [[Pember-75|Mercy Pember]] :: Relationship to Father:  Natural :: Relationship to Mother:  Natural Agnes Way Harris Pember died in February of 1732/33.<ref>[[#Pember|Pember]]: Page 12</ref> 
