2 CONC anscript::"Pember, Thomas, New London 1686, had there bapt. in 1692, Mercy, Thomas and Eliz; in 1694, Ann; and in 1696, John; but only four of thosewith w. Agnes, were liv. at his d. by drown. 27 Sept. 1711. "
