1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hannah (Still) Mabee (1807 - 1899) 
2 CONT ==Birth==
2 CONT Hannah Still was born in 1807 in Whitby, York, Home, Upper Canada to John and Hannah Still. 
2 CONT Note - Grandmother - https://www.geni.com/people/Phebe-Wade-Still/6000000002844439138
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT Samuel H. Mabee and Hannah Still were married on November 14< 1827 in Walsingham Township, Norfolk County, Ontario, Canada. (Maybee. "Maybee Society Organization." Database. John Maybee. Maybee. http://maybeesociety.org/: 2019.)
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT # Simon Mabee 1827 - 1892 married Mary Jane Howey
2 CONT # John G Mabee 1829 - 1909 married Mary Melissa Boice
2 CONT # Gabriel Mabee 1832 - 1874 married Mary Hughill
2 CONT # Alfred E Mabee 1834 - 1911 married Elizabeth Chapman
2 CONT ==Census==
2 CONT Census: 1851 in East Oxford Township, Oxford County, Ontario, Canada
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT * 15, Samuel Mabee, M, 49, M, Farmer, Canada, Baptist (1804)
2 CONT * 16, Hannah Mabee, F, 46, M, Canada East, Baptist (1807)
2 CONT * 17, J Mabee, M, 20, M, Farmer, Canada, Baptist
2 CONT * 18, M Mabee, F, 23, M, England, Baptist
2 CONT * 19, A Mabee, M, 18, S, Labourer, Canada, Baptist
2 CONT
2 CONT **Resided in a one story frame house
2 CONT Census: 1861 in East Oxford Township, Oxford County, Ontario, Canada
2 CONT Note:
2 CONT * 42, Samuel H. Mabee, M, 57, M, Canada, Baptist, Farmer
2 CONT * 43, Hanah Mabee, F, 50, M, Canada, Baptist
2 CONT * 44, Alfred Mabee, M, 21, M, Canada, None, Farmer
2 CONT * 45, Elisa A . Mabee, F, 25, M, Canada, Baptist
2 CONT * 46, Samuel Adgar, M, 6, S, Canada, Baptist
2 CONT ** Resides in a one story frame house
2 CONT
2 CONT and Agricultural Census, Township of East Oxford, ED 2, page 21
2 CONT * 42, Samuel Mabee, Con 3, part of Lot 13, total acreage 46, 41 under cultivation, 28 under crops in 1860, 13 under pasture in 1860, 2 under orchards or garden, and 15 under woods or wild. Farm valued at $2000, Farming equipment v
2 CONC alued at$100
2 CONT 10 April 1891 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Still appeared on the census of 10 April 1891 in the household of John G. Mabee and Mary Melissa Boice at East Oxford Township, Oxford County, Ontario, Canada,
2 CONT
2 CONT *  John Mabee, M, 62, M, Self, Ontario, Ontario, Ontario, Methodist
2 CONT * Mary M Mabee, F, 60, M, Wife, Ontario, Ontario, Ontario, Methodist
2 CONT * Hannah Mabee, F, 82, W, Mother, Ontario, Ontario, Ontario, Baptist
2 CONT * Edith Cole, F, 12, Domestic, Ontario, Ontario, Ontario, Methodist.4 
2 CONT (https://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?db=1274&h=546410&indiv=try&o_vc=Record:OtherRecord&rhSource=8946)
2 CONT ==Probate of John Still's Estate==
2 CONT Gave only son John 100 acres of land. Ordered that his mother Phebe Wade Still 'shall have a good and comfortable support or maintenance out of my estate.' Left wife Hannah property and all personal belongings. Rest of estate divi
2 CONC ded between six daughters - Sophia, Amanda, Hannah, Phebe, Anna, and Mary.https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-C3H6-RQ6J?view=fullText&keywords=John%20Still%2CCanada%2CYork&lang=en&groupId=
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Death==
2 CONT Hannah (Still) Mabee passed away on June 10, 1899 in East Oxford Township, Oxford County, Canada. 
2 CONT
2 CONT **#10 Mabee Hannah F June 10th 1899 92 Lot 13 Con 3 Retired Quebec Old Age no physician Baptist John Mabee informant June 10th 1899 
2 CONT
2 CONT ("Ontario Deaths, 1869-1937 and Overseas Deaths, 1939-1947," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:JKWW-QZ7 : 24 June 2015), Hannah Mabee, 10 Jun 1899; citing East Oxford, Oxford, Ontario, , A
2 CONC rchives of Ontario, Toronto; FHL microfilm 1,854,391.)
2 CONT
