2 CONT Mark (Marcus) Bigler (Beegler)Mark (Marcus) Bigler (Beegler) (b. 1705, d. 25 Apr 1787)
2 CONT
2 CONT Mark (Marcus) Bigler (Beegler) 
2 CONT *(son of Hans Jacob Bigler and Anna Maria Volger) was born 1705 in Nr River Rhine, , , Germany and 
2 CONT *died 25 Apr 1787 in Pipe Creek, Frederick, Maryland, USA. 
2 CONT *He married Catherine Bigler on 1733 in , Lancaster, Pennsylvania, USA.
2 CONT *More About Mark (Marcus) Bigler (Beegler): Arrival: 1733, Pennsylvania.42
2 CONT *More About Mark (Marcus) Bigler (Beegler) and Catherine Bigler: Marriage: 1733, Lancaster, Pennsylvania, USA.
2 CONT
