2 CONT SOURCE:  FROM THE WILL OF MARK BIGLER  25 APR 1787 AT FREDERICK CO. COURTHOUSE, MARYLAND & BIGLER TEMPLE BOOK. LOUIS BURTRAN BIGLER, JR.  WEST JORDAN, UTAH
