2 CONT
2 CONT MARK BIGLER ARRIVED IN LANCASTER COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA IN 1733. HE AND HIS WIFE HAD ELEVEN CHILDREN.  HE LATER MOVED TO FREDERICK COUNTY, MARYLAND WHERE HIS WILL WAS PROVED IN 1787.
2 CONT
2 CONT  MARK BIGLER ARRIVED IN LANCASTER COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA IN 1733. HE AND HIS WIFE HAD ELEVEN CHILDREN.  HE LATER MOVED TO FREDERICK COUNTY, MARYLAND WHERE HIS WILL WAS PROVED IN 1787.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Some records show a child #3 - Miss Bigler, born abt 1737, of Frederick County, MD.  She supposedly married a "Mr. Randabush".  Her Temple work was: Baptism    22 June 1960 Endowment:    9 Aug 1960 Sealed to Parents:    13 Oct 196
