1 TITL Pvt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was a Revolutionary War patriot in the Continental Army.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/89770804/jacob-bigler
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of the immigrant Mark Bigler, he was raised in Carroll County, Maryland. On July 28, 1776, he enlisted as a private in the Sixth Company of the German Regiment of Foot commanded by Col. Baron Arendt, sometimes referred to as C
2 CONC aptain George P. Keeport's First German Batallion of Continental Troops in Maryland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah Booher and they were the parents of nine children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in his apple orchard. Later, his grave was dug up and dirt from it moved to the IOOF Cemetery in Enterprise, West Virginia where a monument to him was erected  (see photo)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Jacob Bigler BIRTH	1752 Bucks County, Pennsylvania, USA DEATH	29 Sep 1829 (aged 76–77) Enterprise, Harrison County, West Virginia, USA BURIAL	 IOOF Cemetery Enterprise, Harrison County, West Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/89770804
2 CONT
2 CONT s/o Mark and Catherine Bigler h/o Hannah Booher
2 CONT
2 CONT Veteran of the Revolutionary War
2 CONT -----
2 CONT Son of the immigrant Mark Bigler, he was raised in Carroll County, Maryland. On July 28, 1776, he enlisted as a private in the Sixth Company of the German Regiment of Foot commanded by Col. Baron Arendt, sometimes referred to as C
2 CONC aptain George P. Keeport's First German Batallion of Continental Troops in Maryland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah Booher and they were the parents of nine children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was buried in his apple orchard. Later, his grave was dug up and a bushel of dirt from it moved to the IOOF Cemetery in Enterprise, West Virginia where a monument to him was erected.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Bigler Righter - Ross 1780–1880
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah Bigler McCally 1783–1834 	
2 CONT Mark Bigler 1785–1839 	
2 CONT Ruth Bigler Whiteman 1788–1839 	
2 CONT Bathsheba Bigler Smith 1789–1825
2 CONT
2 CONT Nancy Ann Bigler Whiteman 1790–1830 	
2 CONT Jacob Bigler 1793–1859
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/89770804/jacob-bigler
