1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Theodocia (Bates) Noble''' was born on August 7, 1789 in Egremont, Berkshire County, Massachusetts, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-63543859 Joseph Bates] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-63537082
2 CONC  Sarah Ann (Deming) Bates]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Theodocia married [https://www.geni.com/profile-63545173 Ezekial Noble] in June 1808 in Egremont, Massachusetts. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-85480750 Joseph Bates Noble]; [https://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/profile-69793638 Sarah Ann Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-69795393 Eunice Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63548014 Rhoda Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63535514 Elenora Persilia Noble]; [https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/profile-63537292 Leonora Cordelia Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63546229 Mary Sophia Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63549558 Rebecca Maria Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63550663 John Ezekial Noble]; [ht
2 CONC tps://www.geni.com/profile-63548001 Harvey Sylvester Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63549816 Robert Delano Noble]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-34673623852 Susanna (Noble) Grant]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on December 4, 1869 in Fayette, Fayette County, Iowa, United States. 
2 CONT ----
