1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Elizabeth Drake Dunn=
2 CONT * BIRTH 25 Dec 1653
2 CONT * DEATH 1711 (aged 57–58)
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 49077616
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Drake, a daughter of Francis (not the famous English navigator) and Mary (Walker) Drake, was born in England in 1648 and came to America with her family.  She married Hugh Dunn on Dec. 19, 1670 in Piscataway, her husband
2 CONC  bought 90 acres of land in Woodbridge, NJ in the same year.  He continued to live in Piscataway and was given a patent for 138 acres of land there in 1678.  He was one of the founders of the Baptist Church ofs Piscataway in 1678.
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband came to Dover NH abt 1660-64 and emigrated to NJ abt 1666 with Hull and Martin families. Was among the founders of Piscataway and Woodbridge. Note:  Elizabeth's father, Francis Drake was another early settler in the Hopewe
2 CONC ll Baptist Community in 1668. He was a kinsman of he Great Elizabethan Admiral, Sir Francis Drake. It is believed that he was the granson of Thomas Drake, brother of Sir Francis Drake. Some say Elizabeth was b. Dover, N H. "The Be
2 CONC ginnings of Three New Jersey Family Lines" p 26 says Elizabeth, 2nd child of Francis & Mary Drake, b. in Portsmouth. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth & Hugh md. 24 yr & had nine children: Mary in 1672, Francis in 1674, Elizabeth in 1676, Hugh in 1678, Martha Ann in 1681, Samuel in 1683, Jonathan in 1688, Joseph in 1689 and Benjamin in 1694.  When her husband died in 1
2 CONC 694, Elizabeth was the executrix of his will. (See his memorial for an extract.)  Elizabeth died about 1711.  She survived Hugh. Some have a son Daniel, for Hugh & Elizabeth.
2 CONT
2 CONT When her husband died in 1694, Elizabeth was the executrix of his will. (See his memorial for an extract.)  Elizabeth died about 1711. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Notes'''
2 CONT "Catherine Ann" as a middle name for Elizabeth as was shown as part of her name but has not been seen in sources. AR
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Francis Robert Drake 1615–1687
2 CONT Mary Walker Drake 1625–1688
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Hugh Dunn 1640–1694
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT George Drake 1651–1710
2 CONT John Drake 1655–1740
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 11x
2 CONT Mary Dunn Bonham 1/19/1671–aft.1705 m. Hezekiah Bonaham 1690
2 CONT Francis,  3/5/1673/4-d. young
2 CONT Elizabeth,  3/19/1675/6-aft. 1707  m. John Runyon July 20, 1692
2 CONT Ann Elizabeth Dunn Runyon 1676–1756
2 CONT Hugh Dunn Jr. 11/18/1678–1736  m. Elizabeth Martin Aug. 9, 1697
2 CONT Martha Dunn   7/13/1681 – 1738 
2 CONT Samuel, 3/22/1683/4-aft. 1723 m. Esther Martin 1704
2 CONT Jonathan  6/3/688. d. young
2 CONT Hannah Drake Dunn   1681 – 1748 
2 CONT Joseph Dunn  1/20/1689 – 1748 m. Hannah Fits Randolph Drake 1711
2 CONT Benjamin,  8-4-1694- aft. 1728  m.Sarah Johnston  Aug 14 1719
2 CONT
