2 CONT === Life Sketch ===
2 CONT NOTE - Same as Martha Ann Dunn  LZBT-Z19 but they cannot be merged at this time.  Probably best to provide any changes, sources, etc. to Martha Ann Dunn LZLX-LY2 since she has correct husband, sources and notes.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Record on Find a Grave states Martha Dunn Drake "was the daughter of Hugh and Elizabeth (Drake) Dunn. She married first Thomas Runyon and second Jeremiah Drake." Are there records to show this relationship? findagrave.com/memorial
2 CONC /49075646/martha-ann-runyan#source
2 CONT
2 CONT Another Record on Find a grave states the following: Martha was the wife of Thomas Runyan, but her parentage is disputed. Some say that she is the daughter of Hugh Dunn and Elizabeth Drake Dunn, but this has never been proved.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha and Thomas married about 1698 in Piscataway, Middlesex Co., New Jersey. They had twelve children: Catherine in 1700, Vincent about 1701, Thomas in 1702, Joseph in 1704, Martha in 1706, Anne in 1707, Aaron in 1709, Ephraim i
2 CONC n 1711, Samuel in 1715, Elizabeth in 1719, Reuben in 1721 and John, whose birth year is unknown. The family lived in Hopewell Twp.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha died before her husband's will was probated on 16 April 1753. https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/49075646/martha-ann-runyan#source
2 CONT
