1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Joseph Dunn, a son of Hugh and Mary (Drake) Dunn, was born in Piscataway, NJ January 20, 1689 and died there after 1730.  He married his first cousin, '''Hannah Drake''', in Piscataway in 1711. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah, a daughter of John and Martha (Martin) Drake, was born in Piscataway and died there after 1730.  
2 CONT Children of Joseph and Hannah (Drake) Dunn.  
2 CONT *  11.  (1). James                   b.Sep  3 1712
2 CONT *  12.  (2). Martha                  b.Aug 23 1714
2 CONT *  13.  (3). Hezekiah                b.Jun 21 1716         m.Marcia Budd? 1732
2 CONT *  14.  (4). Rachel                  b.Jul 18 1718
2 CONT *  15.  (5). Benajah                 b.Jun 13 1720 
2 CONT *  16.  (6). Joseph Jr.              b.Jul 29 1722 
2 CONT *  17.  (7). Benjamin                b.       1724         m.Sarah <nowiki>-----</nowiki>
2 CONT *  18.  (8). Elizabeth               b.       1726 
2 CONT *  19.  (9). Hannah                  b.       1728
2 CONT
