2 CONT When Phillip Dunn was born on 14 June 1754, in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey, United States, his father, Jeremiah Dunn, was 41 and his mother, Margaret Carman, was 35. He had at least 1 son and 1 daughter with Jane Martin. He 
2 CONC registered for military service in 1812. He died on 29 April 1835, in Pennsylvania, United States, at the age of 80, and was buried in Coons Corners, Hayfield Township, Crawford, Pennsylvania, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
