4 CONT I got interested in this family because of the log cabin home built by Judge Benjamin Piatt in Logan County, Ohio. My in-laws stopped there several years ago and I just stumbled across a post card they brought back as a souvenir. 
4 CONC I looked for the family on Geni and found it. I started to research them and discovered they were Huguenots, so I added them to that project and put the family on my to-do list. MUCH research remains to be done as there are a lot 
4 CONC of conflicting stories about the family. It's not until we reach the early 1800's that we start finding reliable documentation. 
4 CONT
4 CONT If you have documents and such for  your Pyott line, I hope you will add them to the Geni profiles. 
4 CONT
4 CONT Happy New Year!
4 CONT Maria
