1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Rene Piatt''' was the son of Rene Piatt and wife Elizabeth Sheffield. He was born c.1679 in New Jersey and died in 1706 in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey. Some researchers believe he is the same person as bro
2 CONC ther Thomas Piatt.
