1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Thomas Piatt,''' son of Rene and Elizabeth Sheffield Piatt, was born May 11, 1681 in Piscataway, New Jersey, and died 1706 in Piscataway, New Jersey. He married Mercy Hull February 01, 1699 in Piscataway, New Je
2 CONC rsey. She was the daughter of Samuel Hull and Mary Manning, and the sister of Mary Hull who married Thomas's brother Jacob Piatt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas Piatt and Mercy Hull are:
2 CONT * Mercy Piatt b: December 11, 1700 in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey d: Woodbridge, Middlesex, New Jersey
2 CONT * Mary Piatt b: January 12, 1701/02 in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey d: Woodbridge, Middlesex, New Jersey m: Elephabt Jones (ancestors of Howard M Vail hvail@worldnet.att.net)
2 CONT * James Piatt b: October 03 (or 10), 1704 in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey d: September 22, 1779 Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey m: Mar 6, 1727/28 Piscataway, Middlesex Co, New Jersey, Ruth Fitzrandolph b: Jun 11, 1706 Pisca
2 CONC taway, Middlesex Co, New Jersey d: Sep 10, 1776 Piscataway, Middlesex Co, New Jersey (ch: Experience Piatt b: Sep 17, 1733)
2 CONT * Samuel Piatt b: c1705/06 in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey d: Shiloh, New Jersey
