2 CONT Dr. Lewis Ford Dunham
2 CONT
2 CONT US Revolutionary War surgeon
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Lewis Dunham,son of Colonel Azariah Dunham. On Wednesday, Feb. 14, 1776, the Provincial Congress of New Jersey passed the following resolution: "Resolved, unanimously, that Mr. Lewis Dunham be recommended by' this Congress to 
2 CONC the Honorable Continental Congress as surgeon for the third battalion now raising in this colony." 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Lewis Dunham served three tours of duty as surgeon, Third Battalion New Jersey Line. Was commissioned surgeon, 3rd battalion (first establishment), February 21, 1776; surgeon 3rd battalion (second establishment), November 28, 
2 CONC 1776; surgeon 3rd Regiment. Resigned.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lewis m. 4 May 1777 Jane Tuthill 1756-1814
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Colonel Azariah Dunham & 2nd wife Mary Ford.
2 CONT
2 CONT ....
2 CONT ...
2 CONT ..
2 CONT .
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio;
2 CONT
2 CONT By
2 CONT
2 CONT  Jonathan Robert De Mallie, Garden State Historian
