1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Mr MECHLING, of Denver CO, died there Tuesday (Jan 1965)
2 CONT
2 CONT Services for J CLinton MECHLING, former Pittsburgh resident and retired official of the American Radiator-Standard Sanitary Corp, at E B Laughlin FH, W Liberty Ave (Pittsbg?).
2 CONT
2 CONT He was managing supervisor of the Rocky Mtn area bef retirement in 1958, a grad of Carnegie Inst of Technology, member of Alumni Student Council Board. Also, memb First Methodist Ch of Denver, Crafton Lodge No 653, Chartiers Comma
2 CONC ndery No 78, Royal Arch Chp 312 & Syria Temple.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving: widow, Virginia DUFF MECHLING, dtr Mrs Jane M McLAIN of Decatur GA, son James C Jr of Beth Page, LI, NY, bro Paul S of Pittsburgh & 04 gr'chr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial, South Cemetery, Butler PA
2 CONT
2 CONT The Pittsburgh Press 19 Jan 1965, pg 20 col 04
