1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fri, 19 Sep 1975, The Pittsburgh Press, PA, gp 28 Col 01:
2 CONT
2 CONT Paul S MECHLING, 78, died yesterday in Diving Providence Hospital.
2 CONT
2 CONT Active in the insurance business in the Pittsburgh area over 40 yrs, an associate manager of Phoenix Mutual Life Ins Co of Hartford CN.
2 CONT
2 CONT Member of Mt Lebanon United Presbyterian Ch, the Phoenix Hall of Fame, the South Hills Kiwanis Club, Engineers Soc of Western PA, Monongahela Lodge 269 F&AM, Valley of Pittsburgh Consistory, Syria Temple & Southern Caravan 23.
2 CONT
