1 NOTE {geni:about_me} George (Cornwell) Cornell (1539 - 1616) 
2 CONT
2 CONT George Cornell
2 CONT *b: 1539 in Saffron, England
2 CONT *m: 1561 in Terling, Englaand
2 CONT *d: 1636 in Bumstead, England
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT # ID: I28028
2 CONT # Name: George Cornwell
2 CONT # Sex: M
2 CONT # Birth: ABT 1530 in England
2 CONT # Death: in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Joan ?...? b: ABT 1535 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT *   1. Has No Children John Cornwell b: ABT 1561 in England
2 CONT *   2. Has No Children William Cornwell b: ABT 1563 in England
2 CONT *   3. Has No Children Alice Cornwell b: ABT 1565 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 2 Margaret Dagnet b: ABT 1553 in England
2 CONT * Married: ABT 1573
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT *   1. Has No Children George Cornwell b: ABT 1575 in England
2 CONT *   2. Has No Children Avice Cornwell b: ABT 1578 in England
2 CONT *   3. Has No Children Stephen Cornwell b: ABT 1580 in England
2 CONT *   4. Has No Children James Cornwell b: ABT 1582 in England
2 CONT *   5. Has No Children Elizabeth Cornwell b: ABT 1586 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 3 Susan Casse b: ABT 1570 in England
2 CONT * Married: 23 APR 1593 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT *   1. Thomas Cornell b: ABT 1594 in Hertford, Hertfordshire Co., England
2 CONT *   2. Joshua Cornwell b: ABT 1596 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT George also married (2) Joan (Cornell).
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *      	5 	M 	iv 	John (Cornwell) CORNELL
2 CONT *    + 	6 	M 	v 	William (Cornwell) CORNELL
2 CONT *      	7 	F 	vi 	Alice CORNELL
2 CONT
2 CONT George also married (3) Margaret DAGNET.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT *      	8 	M 	vii 	George CORNELL
2 CONT *      	9 	F 	viii 	Avice CORNELL
2 CONT *      	10 	M 	ix 	Stephen CORNELL
2 CONT *      	11 	M 	x 	James CORNELL
2 CONT *      	12 	F 	xi 	Elizabeth CORNELL
2 CONT
2 CONT ---
2 CONT
2 CONT From Familysearch:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://familysearch.org/pal:/MM9.1.1/N2R8-J45
2 CONT
2 CONT "England, Marriages, 1538–1973 ," Geo Cornwell, 1593
2 CONT *groom's name:	 Geo Cornwell
2 CONT *bride's name:	Susan Casse
2 CONT *marriage date:	 23 Apr 1593
2 CONT *marriage place:	 Terling,Essex,England
2 CONT *indexing project (batch) number:	M01505-1
2 CONT *system origin:	 England-ODM
2 CONT *source film number:	 0962530 IT 2
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://records.ancestry.com/George_Cornell_records.ashx?pid=41965593
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT George Cornell (b. 1539, d. 1616) George Cornell (son of Richard Cornewall)60, 60, 60 was born 1539 in Saffron, Walden, Essex, England60, 60, 60, and died 1616 in Stanton, Harcourt, Oxfordshire, England60, 60, 60.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He married 
2 CONT
2 CONT (1) Susan Casse on 159360. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married (2) Margaret Dagnet.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About George Cornell and Susan Casse: Marriage 1: 159360 Marriage 2: 1561, Terling, Essex, England.60 Marriage 3: 23 Apr 1593, Possibly, England.60 Marriage 4: 23 Apr 1593, Terling, Essex, England.60
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George Cornell and Susan Casse are:
2 CONT
2 CONT     +Richard Cornell, b. 1565, Bumstead Tower, Essex, England60, 60, 60, d. 22 Jun 1631, Bumstead Tower, Essex, England60, 60, 60.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of George Cornell and Margaret Dagnet are:
2 CONT
2 CONT     +George Cornell, b. 1539, Saffron, Walden, Essex, England60, 60, 60, d. 1616, Stanton, Harcourt, Oxfordshire, England60, 60, 60.
2 CONT
2 CONT _____________________
2 CONT
2 CONT George Cornell was born circa 1539 at of Essex, England. His father was possibly Richard Cornwall although records are hard to find to prove all the facts, mostly due to multiple name changes. [1] Marriage One
2 CONT
2 CONT According to most trees, George was married three times. He first married a Joan (Unknown) who was buried March 7, 1567 Fairsted, Essex, England. Children of George and Joan
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. (possibly) John, bpt. July 18, 1557 (Fairsted)
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. William, 13 bpt. Oct. 4, 1562 (Fairsted)
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Alice, bpt. July 2, 1565 (Fairsted) Marriage Two
2 CONT
2 CONT Second he was married Sept. 26, 1574 in Terling, Essex, England to Margaret Dagnet, who was buried Nov. 1587 in Terling, Essex, England. Children of George and Margaret
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. George, bpt. Sept. 4, 1575 (Terling)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Avice, bpt. June 1578
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Stephen, bpt. Dec. 26, 1579 (Terling)
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. James, bpt. Dec. 25, 1582 (Terling)
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Elizabeth, bpt. Sept. 11, 1586 (Terling) Marriage Three
2 CONT
2 CONT Lastly, he married Susan Casse circa 1562, born circa 1543 at of Essex, England.[2] Children of George and Susan
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Thomas, b: ABT 1594 in Hertford, Hertfordshire Co., England
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Joshua, bpt. June 1, 1595 (Terling)
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. Sarah, b.1627 in (Essex)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT This family construction is based on the 1975 research of Prentiss Glazier[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT     George Cornwell m1 Joan _____. Children:
2 CONT         William Cornwell, chr Fairsted 4 Oct 1562; m at Terling 26 Sep 1592 Margary Hayward;
2 CONT              ?? Thomas Cornwell, bapt 15 Jun 1595 Saffron Weldon [4]
2 CONT             William Cornwell Jr, youngest of six children christened at Terling, bapt 25 May 1609 and "clearly the ancestor of the Connecticut family." 
2 CONT     m2 at Terling 26 -- 1574 Margaret Dagnet
2 CONT     m3 Terling 23 Apr 1593 Susan Casse
2 CONT         Thomas baptized 24 March 1594 Fairstead, Manor, Essex, England; m Rebecca (Briggs?)
2 CONT             Children incuding their youngest son Joshua, "a name which appears nowhere else among the early Cornells or Cornwells." 
2 CONT         Joshua bapt 1 Jun 1595 Fairstead 
2 CONT
2 CONT Why Glazier believes George of the 1593 marriage to Casse was also the one who was christening two children in the 1560s (including William Cornwell chr Faistred 4 Oct 1562 is not explained by Glazier. Seems like the George who ma
2 CONC rried in 1593 was just as likely to be brother to William who was born 1562.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Sources: The American Genealogist, vol. 51 (1975), pp. 115- 
2 CONT
2 CONT 116. Page 55 of; [5] Sources
