2 CONT     ↑ Unless otherwise noted, Prentiss Glazier, "The English Origin of The Cornwell/Cornell Family," in TAG 51 (January 1875):115-116
2 CONT     ↑ Glazier, unpub. ms 1975
2 CONT     ↑ http://blacktreegenealogy.weebly.com/uploads/5/2/0/7/5207646/public_202010_20vol._202.pdf 
2 CONT
