1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://aleph0.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr05/rr05_177.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 10275. John Cornwall. Born on 13 Aug 1671 in Middletown, CT.143 John died in Middletown, CT, on 26 Apr 1746; he was 74.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 15 Sep 1695 when John was 24, he first married Elizabeth Hinsdale, daughter of Experience Hinsdale (23 Jan 1645/6-19 May 1676) & Mary Hawks (23 May 1652-), in Middletown, CT.143 Elizabeth died on 2 Mar 1697/8 in Middletown, CT.
2 CONC 143
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include: 23254	i.	Elizabeth Cornwall (21 Aug 1696-)
2 CONT
2 CONT On 23 Mar 1698/9 when John was 27, he second married Mary Hilton, daughter of John Hilton (ca 1646-ca 1686), in Middletown, CT.143 Born ca 1673 in Middletown, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include: 23255	i.	Mary Cornwall (25 Aug 1700-) 23256	ii.	Miriam Cornwall (27 Sep 1702-27 May 1772) 23257	iii.	John Cornwall (7 Apr 1705-23 Apr 1746) 23258	iv.	Eunice Cornwall (30 Nov 1709-6 May 1774) 23259	v.	Desire
2 CONC  Cornwall (16 Mar 1710/1-) 23260	vi.	Hannah Cornwall (15 Nov 1715-31 Dec 1739)
