1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Whitmore/6000000124532274832?through=6000000001316224477
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Cornwell was born 21 AUG 1696 in Middletown, Middlesex Co., CT. She married Jacob Dowd on 8 JUN 1716 in Middletown, Middlesex Co., CT.   She was the daughter of John Cornwell Jr. &  Elizabeth Hinsdale.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Disambiguation 
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Elton/6000000008979330444 (Daughter of Samuel Cornwell & Rebecca (Bull) Marriage to John Elton: 16 Jan 1676/1677 Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT * https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Whitmore/6000000124532274832?through=6000000001316224477 (Daughter of Jacob Cornwell & Mary White),Marriage to Ebenezer Wetmore: Marriage: 26 March 1724 Middletown, Middletown, Middlesex, Co
2 CONC nnecticut, USA
2 CONT *https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Lane/6000000001316224477?through=6000000001316224363 (Daughter of John Cornwall & Elizabeth Hinsdale)1)  Marriage to Jacob Doud: Marriage: 8 Jun 1714 Connecticut 2) Marriage to Isaac Lane: Ma
2 CONC rriage: Oct 1736 Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://archive.org/details/descendantsofhen00hartiala/page/6/mode/1up
2 CONT
2 CONT We know less of the descendants of SERGT. JACOB and ELIZABETH (CORNWELL), than of any in this generation. His tombstone is in the old cemetery, Middletown, Conn. He was sent in the expedition to Canada, in 1709. He never regained 
2 CONC his health. The first-born is supposed to have died in infancy, although there is no record of date of birth or death, and of JACOB 2d, the only other son there was no issue. 
2 CONT
2 CONT This record closes with the following enumeration of nis children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 70 JOHN.
2 CONT * 71 ELIZABETH, b. 1720, d. 1736; s.
2 CONT * 72 ESTHER.
2 CONT * 73 JACOB (2d), b. 1725; m. 1765, Mary Whitman (no issue).
2 CONT * 74 SARAH.
2 CONT * 75 RACHEL; m. Thomas Tibbals.
2 CONT * 76 Lois.
2 CONT
