1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daniel D Doolittle, Jr
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH	3 Feb 1706, Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	17 Sep 1791 (aged 85), Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA BURIAL	Center Street Cemetery, Wallingford, New Haven County, Connecticut, USA, MEMORIA
2 CONC L ID 143248062
2 CONT
2 CONT Pictures added by Kathy Smith Wintringham
2 CONT
2 CONT Daniel D Doolittle was a Private in American Revolution War, Ensign in the 1st Connecticut Regiment. Commented by Gen. Davis Wooster. 1Oth Company. (Enlisted: May 1st 1775 and Discharged December 1775).  Married Elizabeth Dayton T
2 CONC he daughter of Isaac and Elizabeth (Todd) Dayton, on Sept 28, 1739 in New Haven, New Haven, Connecticut. Died at the of 85 yrs.
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents	 Daniel Doolittle, 1675–1755	 Hannah Cornwall Doolittle, 1677–1736
2 CONT
