1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Esther WARD24 was born on 15 December 1669 in Middletown, Middlesex County, Connecticut. She died on 13 July 1734 at the age of 64 in Middletown, Middlesex County, Connecticut. Esther married William Cornwell, 22 J
2 CONC an 1692.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links 
