1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Note from findagrave.com:
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/162932392/Esther-Parmelee
2 CONT
2 CONT There is confusion about Esther Kelsey Parmelee's death date. Some sources on ancestry.com claim her death date was 21 May 1712, which is not possible if she was the mother of Hannah, Ezra, Abner and Sarah Parmelee, who were all b
2 CONC orn later than that date. 
2 CONT
2 CONT It is possible that Esther married widower Samuel Sanford of Milford, Ct., whose wife Hannah died in 1726. If she married Samuel in 1726, the youngest of his 11 children would have been 10 and 12 years old, and she would have had 
2 CONC 5 minor children between the ages of 8 and 16. 
2 CONT
2 CONT There has been an assumption made by some sources (e.g., "A genealogy of the Descendants of William Kelsey Who Settled at Cambridge Mass in 1632," Vol I, Third Generation) that Esther Kelsey Parmelee died in Killingworth, but her 
2 CONC death does not appear in the Killingworth Town Records. If she married Samuel Sanford, who died in Milford, CT., in 1749, it is possible she moved to and died in Milford.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternate dates:  12/25/1673 - 3/1/1718.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Esther and Nathaniel were married in 1696 in Killingworth, Connecticut.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.ancestry.com/family-tree/person/tree/15109292/person/420247958810 Ancestry Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 19 2018, 19:57:53 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Cornwall-645
2 CONT
2 CONT See: https://archive.org/details/williamcornwallh00corn
2 CONT
2 CONT According to this document William , b 1/22/1672, son of Samuel 1667 and Rebecca Bull of Cambridge Ma, married Esther , maiden name unknown. He had 2 daughters Jemima bap 2/4/1700 and Lois b 1702. Jemima m Stephen Bradley of Guilf
2 CONC ord in 1718. Lois m Daniel Collins in 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel 's brother William also had a son William b 9/13/1671. He married Esther Ward b 1673 in 1692. dtr of John and Mary Harris. They had 8 children none named Jemima.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-40001-715581437/esther-kelsey-in-familysearch-family-tree FamilySearch Family Tree] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 3 2020, 7:17:12 UTC''
2 CONT
