2 CONT According to this document William , b 1/22/1672, son of Samuel 1667 and Rebecca Bull of Cambridge Ma, married Esther , maiden name unknown. He had 2 daughters Jemima bap 2/4/1700 and Lois b 1702. Jemima m Stephen Bradley of Guilf
2 CONC ord in 1718. Lois m Daniel Collins in 1725.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel 's brother William also had a son William b 9/13/1671. He married Esther Ward b 1673 in 1692. dtr of John and Mary Harris. They had 8 children none named Jemima.
