1 NOTE Possibly daughter of Samuel Clark and Hannah Tuttle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Most list Abigail Clark's birth year as 1689, however, this would mean that Abigail was only about 12 years old when she married and had son George.  Though possible, this seems unlikely.  Others have listed Abigail's birth 
2 CONC year around 1679 which would seem to make more sense.
