2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sgt. Whitmore is a son of Lieu. Francis Whitmore and wife, Hannah Harris. He was their first born of 10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT His death year is based on his Will dated 4 April 1748 and an estate inventory taken 8 May 1750.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary Cornwell 30 May 1698 at Middletown, Middlesex, Conn. and they were the parents of twelve children.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/123484785/francis-whitmore Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.g
2 CONC eni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''May 11 2020, 2:32:05 UTC''
