2 CONT rief Life History of Daniel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Daniel Whitmore was born on 1 May 1741, in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States, his father, Daniel Whitmore, was 27 and his mother, Mehitable Hubbard, was 32. He married Sarah Hall on 10 January 1764, in Middlet
2 CONC own, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 7 May 1816, in Sunderland, Franklin, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 75, and was buried in Sunderland, Fr
2 CONC anklin, Massachusetts, United States.
