2 CONT Note from John D. Curtis:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Most Ancestry.com sources name this lady Sarah Hubbard Foster Butler.  She takes as her middle name her mother's maiden name.  Her mother is identified as Sarah Hubbard (1680-1756), wife of Edward Foster (1681 - 1753).  This Sar
2 CONC ah's marriage date is identified as 12-03-1728 in Middletown, Conn.
2 CONT # However, there is a party on Geni.com who has connected another woman to John Butler as a second wife.  That lady is Sarah Hubbard Rust Butler.  Her parents are identified as Abraham Foster and Abigail Parsons.  This Sarah's mar
2 CONC riage date is identified as 11-12-1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
