1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Frederick Augustus Harding (see notes below), son of Frederick Augusta Harding and Lucy Elizabeth Phelps, was born 1879 in Iowa. He married on Jan. 8, 1901 with NINA C. LEWIS. She was born Jan. 14, 1969 in Bayard, 
2 CONC Iowa. He died 1951; she died in Clara City, Minnesota on Dec. 12, 1969; both buried at Sunset Memorial Cemetery, Montevideo, Minnesota.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Per relative Robert Emery Harding: This member of the family used the middle name of Augustus (see draft regis below)'.
2 CONT
2 CONT *1880 census: Fred Harding (0, b Iowa); in Franklin, Marion Co., Iowa w parents and sibs.
2 CONT *1910 census: Fred A. Harding (30, b IA) and wife Nina Harding (31, b IA); in Franklin, Greene Co., Iowa w ch. Emery (7, b IA) and Leslie (3, b IA). Also there is his brother Seth Harding (26, b IA).
2 CONT *1918 WWI draft regis: Fred. Augustus Harding, born 1/10/1879 in Iowa; aged 39, farmer, res of 2 Montevideo, Chippewa, Minnesota. Relative: Mrs. Nina Harding. Med hgt & build, brown eyes, brown hair. Registered 9/12/1918 Chippewa 
2 CONC Co., MN.
2 CONT *1920 census: Fred A. Harding (40) and wife Nina C. (41); in Leenthrop, MN w ch. Emery A. (17, b Iowa) and Leslie W. (12, b iowa). Also residing there is his brother Seth Harding (35, b Iowa) and his wife Ella S. Harding (25, b MN
2 CONC ).
2 CONT *1951 Soc Sec Death Index: Fred A. Harding died 6/6/1951 in Chipewa Co., MN.
2 CONT *1930 census: Fred A. Harding (51) and wife Nina C. Harding (52); in Leenthrop, MN w son Emery A. (27).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fred A Harding'''  .....  Birth:  1879  Death:  1951 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Sunset Memorial Cemetery  Montevideo Chippewa County Minnesota, USA 
2 CONT
