2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Information of Life
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Bird was born in Towchester, Northamptonshire, England, in—say—1560, and died in Towchester on July 18, 1622. Amy _____ of Towchester, Northamptonshire, England died in Towchester on April 19, 1625. They were married in Tow
2 CONC chester on Tuesday, April 14, 1584. She took the name Amy Bird. He is the son of Richard and Joanne (_____) Bird. 
2 CONT
2 CONT An unknown number of children were born, but included: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Dorothy Bird [#2063]: She was born in Towcester, Northampton, England, on May 25, 1588, and died in Hartford, Connecticut, on August 2, 1676.   
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes on the Founding of New England, page 330, give the will of Robert Bird:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Will of Robert Bird of Toceter, co. Northants, joiner; dated 18July 1622    
2 CONT *  I desire to be buried in the churchyard of Towcester.
2 CONT *     I bequeath to my wife, Amye Bird, all my household goods, I possessed when my daughter Perris Tighte, widow, was married to her late husband, George Tighte.
2 CONT *     To my daughter Lord, wife of Thomas Lord of Towcester, 40 s. 
2 CONT *     All the residue of my goods to my daughter Perris Tighte, to bring up her sever fatherless children, & I make her my executrix.
2 CONT *     Signed: Robert Bird
2 CONT *     Witnesses: John Hastings, the elder, Richard Wood. 
2 CONT *     Proved 1 October 1622, by the executrix
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter Dorithee Byrde married Thomas Lorde in February 1610/11[3]
2 CONT His son in law, George Tight, also a joiner, died a week before Robert made his death bed will. George was buried on 11 July 1522, [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Residence: Towchester, Northhamton County, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Bird-104237 [Parents] was born in 1555/1560 in Towchester, Northampton, England, Great Britain. He was christened in , , England. He died on 18 Jul 1622 in Towchester, Northampton, England, Great Britain. He was buried on 2
2 CONC 2 Jul 1622 in Towchester, Northampton, England, Great Britain. He married Amy Hill-104238 on 12 Oct 1567 in Towchester, Northampton, England, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT *https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Robert_Bird_%2821%29
2 CONT
