2 CONT
2 CONT >'Robert Bird was buried at Towcester, 22 July 1622, and in his will dated four days earlier named his wife Amy, his "daughter Lord, wife of Thomas Lord of Towcester," and daughter Perris widow of Geroge Tighte. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Robert_Bird_%2821%29
2 CONT
2 CONT daughter Dorithee Byrde married Thomas Lorde in February 1610/11[3]
2 CONT His son in law, George Tight, also a joiner, died a week before Robert made his death bed will. George was buried on 11 July 1522, [4]  7 children 
