2 CONT     * Joseph Stanton+ b. 22 Jan 1668, d. 1751
2 CONT     * Thomas Stanton+ b. Apr 1670
2 CONT     * Ann Stanton b. 1 Oct 1673, d. 23 Mar 1680
2 CONT     * Theophilus Stanton+ b. 16 Jan 1676, d. 1705
2 CONT     * Dorothy Stanton b. 1680, d. 28 Apr 1699
