2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT This profile describes Hannah Lord, born in 1656, who became the second wife of Joseph Stanton. Nothing is certain about her ancestry. Wheeler (1900) states that "...he [Joseph Stanton] married for his second wife, Hannah Lord, hi
2 CONC s cousin, of Hartford, Aug. 13, 1677, who was b. in 1656. Mrs. Hannah Stanton d. April 6, 1681." Should additional data emerge from a credible source, this profile should be edited accordingly.
2 CONT
2 CONT There were 2 children of this union.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
