2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was born about 1659. She is the daughter of Thomas Lord and Hannah Thurston. Mary's father died between the date of his will, 28 Oct 1661, and the date of estate inventory, 5 Apr 1662; Mary was about three years old. Mary's m
2 CONC other, sole heir to Thomas' estate, died about 1670, when Mary was about ten years old. When Mary attained the age of 16 (then the age at which a fatherless child could choose a guardian),[1] Mary chose George Gardner. That choice
2 CONC  was approved by the court on 2 Mar 1675/6,[2] which establishes Mary's latest possible date of birth as 2 Mar 1659/60. Also in 1675, Mary inherited a bed from her grandmother Dorothy Lord.[3] The inheritance and assignment of gua
2 CONC rdianship, both in 1675, suggest that she was in the care of her grandmother after her mother's death. At age 18, Mary inherited two ewes from her aunt Sarah Lord.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary passed away in 1717.F[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
