2 CONT ↑ Find a Grave, database and images (accessed 03 October 2021), memorial page for Mary Lord Pemberton (1659–4 Dec 1717), Find A Grave: Memorial #32575881; Maintained by Kathy Sexton (contributor 46947633) Unknown, who reports a bu
2 CONC ried somewhere in CT.
2 CONT Porter, William. Historical Notices of Connecticut (Connecticut Historical Society, 1842) Page 8
