2 CONT >Mary Lord, b. 1659, d. Dec. 4, 1717; m. (1) Dec 15, 1681, Samuel Miner, b. Mar. 4, 1652-53, d. 1682, son of Thomas and Grace Palmer Miner—no issue—served in King Phillip's War in 1676; m. (2) Mar. 19, 1682-83, Joseph Pemberton of
2 CONC  Stonington, Conn., b. July 2, 1655, d. Oct 14, 1702, son of James and Sarah Marshall Pemberton.
2 CONT
