2 CONT
2 CONT NICHOLAS OLMSTED, b. in England; bap. at Fairsted, Eng., Feb.  15, 1612; d. Aug. 31, 1684; m. (1) Sept. 28, 1640, Sarah Loomis, of Windsor,  Conn.; b. 1617; dau. of Joseph and Mary (White) Loomis; d. 1667; (2) Mrs.  Mary Lord, of 
2 CONC Wethersfield, Conn., widow of Dr. Thomas Lord. 
