1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	Aug. 16, 1651 Saybrook Point Middlesex County Connecticut, USA Death: 	1739
2 CONT
2 CONT The son of William & Hattie (Nickerson) Lord, he married Esther/Hester Ward about 1696. According to First Settlers of Conn. & Mass, Goodwin, p. 355, he was a sea captain. His mother's will dated Feb. 8, 1670: "I give unto my son 
2 CONC Robert Lord, if he live after my decease, so long as to have notice ofthis my will, three acres of my upper meadow lot, adjoining that I have given to my daughter Gilbert ..... And in case my son Robert shall depart this life befo
2 CONC re he hath notice of this my last will, then that three acres of land given to him shall be divided between my son William and my grandson Richard Lord ." His birth, death & place of death from "HISTORY AND GENEALOGY OF THE FAMLIE
2 CONC S OF OLD FAIRFIELD", by Jacobus. His place of burial is unknown. 
2 CONT
