2 CONC 01220114049
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Married May 15,1648
2 CONT
2 CONT Recent article: Leslie Mahler, The English Origin of John Baisey/Baysey of Hartford, Connecticut: Cousin of the Olmstead Family of Hartford,? The American Genealogist 82 (2007):32-38. The author demonstrates that John Baisey, who 
2 CONC had settled in Hartford by 1639, was baptized at Dedham, Essex, in 1612, son of John and Mary (Slaney) Baisey. The immigrant's mother's sister was Frances (Slaney) Olmstead, wife of Richard Olmstead and mother of the Olmstead sibl
2 CONC ings who came to Hartford. [From Grt Mig Begins Newsletter Oct-Dec 2007]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably not the sister of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Basye-of-Hartford/6000000166743334856?through=6000000166743014975 from Essex England 
2 CONT
