1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Moses Palmer married probably in Hartford Dorothy Gilbert, a daughter of Captain John and Amy Lord Gilbert, whose baptism is not recorded with those of the other children of Captain John Gilbert in the First Church
2 CONC  book of Hartford. She became a member of the First Church in Stonington at the time her third child was baptized. Moses Palmer died in Stonington July 6, 1701 she died there April 10, 1717. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had children:
2 CONT # Moses born October 29, 1673 baptized November 15, 1674 
2 CONT # Dorothy born August 11, 1675 (December 7) 
2 CONT # John born September 1, 1677 (December 2, 1677) 
2 CONT # Amie baptized April 25, 1680 
2 CONT # Rebecca baptized April 30, 1682 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/L2LB-6Z2/dorothy-gilbert-1651-1717
2 CONT
