1 OCCU of Westfield
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	Oct. 1, 1626 Derby Derbyshire, England  (or? Edworth, Bedfordshire, England)
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Sep. 3, 1684 Westfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT John was the second born of seven children born to Thomas and Margery (Easton) Ingersoll. John was born in England and immigrated to America (Salem, Mass.), at the age of 14, with his older brother, Richard, in 1629. He later move
2 CONC d to Hartford, Conn. He was married to: (1) Dorothy (Lord) in 1651 and they had three daughters: Hannah, Dorothy and Margery 'Mary'. He next married (2) Abigail (Bascom) in 1657 and they had five children: Abigail, Sarah, Abijah, 
2 CONC Hester and Thomas. Later he married (3) Mary (Hunt) in 1668 and they had seven children: John, Abel, Ebenezer, Joseph, Mary, Benjamin and Jonathan.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouses:
2 CONT   Abigail Bascom Ingersoll (1636 - 1668)*
2 CONT   Mary Hunt Ingersoll (1640 - 1690)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Thomas Ingersoll (1668 - 1732)*
2 CONT   Ebenezer Ingersoll (1673 - 1682)*
2 CONT   Jospeh Ingersoll (1675 - 1704)*
2 CONT   Mary Ingersoll (1677 - 1690)*
2 CONT   Benjamin Ingersoll (1679 - 1704)*
2 CONT   Jonathan Ingersoll (1681 - 1760)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Old Burying Ground  Westfield Hampden County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: J. Bean Record added: Jul 09, 2005  Find A Grave Memorial# 11317291
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT John was the brother of [http://www.geni.com/people/Richard-Ingersoll/6000000012988876721?through=6000000006444459686 Richard Ingersoll], in the year 1629 they came from Bedfordshire, England and settled in Salem, Massachusetts. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John lived for awhile with Richard and his wife Ann, after his brothers death he settled in Hartford, Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married 1st Dorothy Lord and had 2 dau. born in Hartford, 
2 CONT * Hannah 1652 and  
2 CONT * Dorothy 1654, Dorothy died  In 1657 
2 CONT
2 CONT in 1655 the family relocated to Northampton, Massachusetts in Jan. 1656 
2 CONT *Margery was born .in 1656 
2 CONT
2 CONT John married 2nd Abigail Bascom (dau. of Thomas Bascom), they had four daughters: 
2 CONT * Abigail January 11, 1658, 
2 CONT * Sarah October 30, 1660, 
2 CONT * Abiah August 24, 1663 and 
2 CONT * Hester September 09, 1665.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1666 the family relocated to 'Woronoco' (Indian name as then known for Westfield, Massachusetts) April of the same year his wife Abigail Bascom died.
2 CONT
2 CONT  In 1667 he married 3rd Mary Hunt (dau. of John Hunt & Mary Webster), they had 7 sons and 1 dau. born in Westfield, 
2 CONT * Thomas March 28, 1668, 
2 CONT * John October 20, 1669, 
2 CONT * Abel November 11, 1671, 
2 CONT * Ebenezer October 15, 1673, 
2 CONT * Joseph October 16, 1675, 
2 CONT * Mary November 17, 1677, 
2 CONT * Benjamin November 15, 1679,
2 CONT *  Jonathan May 10, 1681.
2 CONT
2 CONT Genealogical and personal memoirs relating to the families of the ..., Volume 4 By William Richard Cutter, William Frederick Adams PG.2631-2633
2 CONT
