1 NOTE {geni:about_me} AKA Dorothy Phelps; Dorothy Root. Dorothy Chapin & Dorothy Miller
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ingersoll-36
2 CONT
2 CONT >Dorothy Ingersoll, daughter and 2nd child of John and Dorothy (Lord) Ingersoll, and b. Hartford, 1654, d. Westfield, Mass. Her father, John Ingersoll, of England, in Hartford in 1651, Northampton. Mass., 1666, Westfield 1668-9. H
2 CONC e married three times. Dorothy Lord was daughter of Thomas Lord, Gentleman', and Dorothy his wife, of England, and one of the first and most prominent settlers of Hartford. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >Dorothy Ingersoll married first Jacob Phelps 2 May, 1672, and had 7 children.   She married second Mr. Root about 1689 after the death of Jacob Phelps 06 Oct 1689.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT Four marriages.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Jacob Phelps was the son of George 1606–1687 & Frances 1611–1690. He married Dorothy Ingersoll (b 1654 ), daughter of John Ingersoll and Dorothy Lord.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #Dorothy Phelps 1673–1674
2 CONT #Dorothy Phelps 1675–1757
2 CONT #Hannah Phelps 1677–1755
2 CONT #Israel Phelps 1681–1713
2 CONT #Benjamin Phelps 1683–1731
2 CONT #Joseph Phelps 1686–1735
2 CONT #Jedediah Phelps 1688–1752
2 CONT #Jacob Phelps 1689–
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Unknown Root d. before 1710 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Japhet Chapin (1642-1712) married 31 May 1711 in Springfield, Hampshire, Province of Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Obadiah Miller Jr (1658-1731) married after 18 Mar 1720/1 in Springfield, Hampshire, Province of Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Dorothy was the first wife of John Ingersoll. They had 3 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah born 1652 Hartford, Conn, Dorothy born 1654 Hartford, Conn and Margery born January 1656 Northampton, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Genealogical and personal memoirs relating to the families of the ..., Volume 4 By William Richard Cutter, William Frederick Adams PG.2631-2633
