1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anna Graves, born about 1583, lived in London. Anna Graves had only one daughter, who died by 1675. A widow Ann Graves (possibly the same as Anna Graves) of Great Monores St., St. Botulph Parish, Aldgate (or Olgate
2 CONC ), London, by will proven in 1676 gave annuities to the children of Deacon [https://www.geni.com/people/Deacon-George-Graves-of-Hartford/6000000002046132897 George Graves] in case her grandson, Joseph Hardey, had no children.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
