2 CONC . 580). In August 1695, Thomas and Elizabeth Graves witness a deed (York Bk. 1665-1701, p. 26). The Virginia Quit Rent Rolls of 1704 show a Thomas Graves in King William Co. with 100 ac. King William was a new county having been f
2 CONC ormed from King and Queen Co. in 1702.
