1 NOTE {geni:about_me}   Priscilla Graves (6) married William Markham of Hartford, Conn.  She died about 1668, and definitely before 1673. He was born in 1621 and died in 1689 (or was killed 4 Sept. 1675 at "Beers Hill", Northfield, Mass
2 CONC ., according to Families of Early Hartford, Conn., by Barbour).  They lived in Hadley, Mass.  He secondly married Elizabeth Webster, and had four children by her.  (R‑13, R‑202, R‑204)
2 CONT
