3 CITY Wethersfield
3 STAE Connecticut Colony
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah Graves (4) was born in Hartford, Conn., and died 5 June 1668 in Wethersfield, Conn., in child-bed, at the birth of her daughter Comfort.  She married Jonathan Deming, son of John, on 21 Nov. 1660.  He was bor
2 CONC n about 1639 in Wethersfield, Conn., and died 8 Jan. 1700 in Wethersfield, at about 61 years of age.  After Sarah died, he secondly married Elizabeth Gilbert, daughter of Joseph (or Josiah) and Elizabeth Gilbert, on 25 Dec. 1673 i
2 CONC n Wethersfield.  All children of Sarah and John were born in Wethersfield.  (R‑202, R‑204)
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 
2 CONT # 21 NOV 1660 in Wethersfield, Connecticut to Jonathan Deming (1639-1699) as his 1st wife.  He was the son of John Deming & Honor Treat. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # Jonathan  b: 27 NOV 1661 in Wethersfield, Connecticut
2 CONT # Sarah  b: 12 AUG 1663 in Wethersfield, Connecticut
2 CONT # Mary  b: 11 JUL 1665 in Wethersfield, Connecticut
2 CONT # Comfort  b: 05 JUN 1668 in Wethersfield, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
