2 CONT Thomas Andrews BIRTH	4 May 1638 Hartford, Hartford County, Connecticut, USA DEATH	1691 (aged 52–53) Middletown, Middlesex County, Connecticut, USA BURIAL	 Trinity Church Cemetery Portland, Middlesex County, Connecticut, USA Add to
2 CONC  Map PLOT	269 MEMORIAL ID	42858638 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT Originally Old Quarry Burial
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas was the son of William Andrews. He was originally listed in FindAGrave as a son of William's wife Abigail [Graves]. However, according to According to multiple sources within "U.S. and International Marriage Records, 1560-1
2 CONC 900", Abigail GRAVES and William ANDREWS (b. 1595) were married in 1640, rather than 1632. That means Thomas' mother was William's 1st wife Mary [Unknown, or possibly Savage], who married William in England about 1620, and died in
2 CONC  1639, sometime after Thomas was born.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married Hannah Kirby of Middletown, CT about 1670.
2 CONT
2 CONT Original information provided by FindAGrave Contributor C. Greer.
2 CONT
2 CONT Additional information provided by Grant Sullivan from multiple Sources found in Ancestry.com, and other info posted to FindAGrave.
2 CONT
