2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings	 Esther Andrews Spencer, 1641–1698 Samuel Andrews, 1645–1712
2 CONT
2 CONT Children	 John Andrews, 1673–1736 Sarah Andrews Osborn, 1680–1719 Abigail Andrews Parmele, 1686–1769
2 CONT
2 CONT Gravesite Details 1882 Old Quarry Removal, interment # taken from Portland document copy
