1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Risley (De Risley) Family of Lancashire originates in the early 14th century with the marriage of Robert Fitzhugh de Hindley (AKA Robert de Risley)  and Ellen Culcheth (AKA Ellen de Risley. For their wedding do
2 CONC wry they took both the name and lands of the Risley Estate in Lancashire.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brigetta RISLEY [Parents] 1 was born in 1574 in Oundle, Northampton, Eng. She died on 19/19 Jan 1637/1640. Brigetta married William ANDREW about 1590 in , , England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *    F i  Anna ANDREWS was born in 1593/1594. She died on 30 Aug 1630. 
2 CONT *    M ii  William ANDREWS was born in 1598. He died on 4 Mar 1676. 
2 CONT *    M iii   Edward ANDREW 1 was born about 1598 in , Tywell, Northants, England.  
2 CONT *    F iv   Anna ANDREW 1 was born about 1600 in Of Triwell, Northampton, England. She died about 1630 in Roxbury, Norfolk, Massachusetts.  
2 CONT *    M v Thomas ANDREW 1 was born about 1602 in , London, Northants, England.  
2 CONT *    F vi  Brigetta ANDREW was born about 1603. 
