2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Margaret (Pynchon) Davis — married 6 Dec 1644 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Huldah (Symmes) Davis — married about 1654 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
