2 CONT William Davis
2 CONT Born 24 Jun 1653 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT ANCESTORS 
2 CONT Son of William Davis and Margaret (Pynchon) Davis
2 CONT Brother of Thomas Davis, Benjamin Davis, Elizabeth (Davis) Whitcomb [half], Mary (Davis) Frost [half] and Rebecca (Davis) Lawrence [half]
2 CONT Husband of Mary (Makepeace) Davis — married 1 Mar 1686 in Taunton, Massachusetts
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Rebecca (Davis) Paine, William Davis, Hannah Makepeace (Davis) Gage, Thomas Davis, Abigail (Davis) Hathaway, Jonathan Davis and Remembrance Davis
2 CONT Died 6 Jul 1736 at age 83 in Freetown, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
