2 CONT Biography
2 CONT William was born 25 Jun 1653 and is the son of William Davis and Margaret Pynchon. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary Makepeace 1 Mar 1686.[2][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:[3][2]
2 CONT William b. 11 Jun 1688: m. Keziah Cudworth 24 Jul 1712
2 CONT Thomas, married Lydia
2 CONT John
2 CONT Jonathan, married Sarah Terry, of Freetown, December 24, 1730
2 CONT Remembrance, married (first) Sarah Soul, of Tiverton, (second) Sarah Fox, of Freetown
2 CONT Joseph
2 CONT Elizabeth m. William Cole
2 CONT Rebecca, married John Paine 31 Oct 1705
2 CONT Abigail, married Ephraim Hathaway, of Free town, December 19, 1717
2 CONT Anne, married Robert Evans, January 29, 1723
2 CONT Hannah, married William Gage, of Freetown
2 CONT Ruth.
2 CONT He was a grand juryman in 1697.[3][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT The original will of Wm Davis was dated 6 Aug 1732 at Freetown, Mass.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT He passed away 6 Jul 1753 at Freetown Mass.
2 CONT
