2 CONT From History of the Military Company of the Massachusetts, Now Called ..., Volume 1 By Oliver Ayer Roberts.  Page 245.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=CWUUAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA245&ots=HWCCAe69Nc&dq=william%20davis%201653%20abigail%2
