2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Deborah was born 04 Apr 1700 Little Compton, Newport Co., RI.[1] She was the daughter of David Hilliard and Joanna Andros. She passed away in 06 Apr 1777 Little Compton, Newport Co., RI. [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Isaac Wheaton on 29 Jun 1719 [???]  in Little Compton RI.  He was born  5 Mar 1695 in Swansea, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, the son of John Wheaton and Elizabeth Thurber, and died about 1759 at about age 63 in Wa
2 CONC rren, Bristol, Rhode Island.  His second wife: he was Elizabeth’s widower. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >Conflict on marriage date. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His will is dated 1 March 1754 in Warren, Rhode Island, and proved there 5 November 1759.[2] Inventory was taken on 9 November 1759.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT From Saxbe, William Bart. ''Richard Bowen (1594?-1675), of Rehoboth, Massachusetts, and His Descendants'' (Rhode Island Genealogical Society, 2011) Page 71-72. < [https://archive.org/details/richardbowen159401saxb/page/71/mode/1up
2 CONC  Archive.Org] >
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Isaac and Elizabeth ( _ ) Wheaton:
2 CONT
2 CONT #1. Mary Wheaton5, b. Swansea 18 Nov. 1721. 637. “Mary ye Daughter of Isaac Wheaton and Elizabeth his wife was born ye 18th of  November 1721 about two a Clock in ye after noon 
2 CONT Children of Isaac and Deborah ( _ ) Wheaton, all b. Swansea:
2 CONT * 2. John Wheaton, b. 19 Feb. 1724 638
2 CONT * 3. William Wheaton, b. 22 Dec. 1730. 639
2 CONT * 4. Tabitha Wheaton, b. 21 Feb. 1732.640
2 CONT * 5. Ann Wheaton, b. 21 April 1734.641
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 637. ''Swansea VRs'', 111.  < [https://www.americanancestors.org/databases/massachusetts-vital-records-1620-1850/image?pageName=111&volumeId=13932&filterQuery=daterange:0%20-%201700~page:2&rId=251745225 AmericanAncestors] > 
2 CONT 638. Ibid., 93. The original Swansea record appears to have 1734 overwritten with 1724. < [https://www.americanancestors.org/databases/massachusetts-vital-records-1620-1850/image?pageName=93&volumeId=13932&filterQuery=daterange:0%
2 CONC 20-%201700~page:2&rId=251744853 AmericanAncestors] > 
2 CONT 639.  Ibid., 163.
2 CONT 640. Ibid., 160.
2 CONT 641. Ibid., 33
