2 CONT Brief Life History of Elisha
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elisha Bisbee was born on 28 February 1688, in Hingham, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Elisha Bisbee, was 33 and his mother, Mary Jacob, was 31. He married Sarah Burr on 21 February 1
2 CONC 712, in Hingham, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. He died on 13 March 1737, in Pembroke, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at 
2 CONC the age of 49, and was buried in Center Cemetery, Pembroke, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States.
