2 DATE 7 MAR 1784
2 ADDR
3 CITY Sudbury
3 STAE Massachusetts
3 CTRY United States
1 OCCU Architect of Congo Church 1772
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Captain David Baldwin'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT DAVID 4, Joseph 3, Joseph 2 (my 5th great grandfather..Fay), Joseph 1
2 CONT
2 CONT David Baldwin, son of Joseph Baldwin and Elizabeth Grover was b. in Malden, Massachusetts, September 1, 1701; he d. March 7, 1784. He came from Hingham, Massachusetts to Spencer, Massachusetts about 1740. He was architect of the C
2 CONC ongregational Church, raised June 9, 1772. He married with ABIGAIL BURR, who was born on August 17, 1701 in Hingham, Plymouth, Massachusetts, died in Ashfield, Massachusetts on June 5, 1778. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: Asa (1723), Zebulon (1726), Abigail (1727), Frederick (perhaps d. young as Draper leaves him out of his "History of Spencer", David (1733), Silence (1735), Jonathan (1742), and Mary (1743).
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Lewis' letter numbers the daughters, but does not name them, and Draper's "History of Spencer" leaves out Frederick.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1701 Birth Record: David Baldwin, son of Joseph & Elizabeth Baldwin (Grover), born in Malden, Massachusetts on September 1, 1701.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Baldwin Genealogy from 1500-1881 (1881).  
2 CONT Author: Baldwin, C.C. (Charles Candee), 1834-1895
2 CONT Subject: Baldwin Family
2 CONT Publisher: Cleveland, Ohio [Leader printing company]
2 CONT Possible copyright status: NOT_IN_COPYRIGHT
2 CONT Pg. 484, 492 
