1 NAME David /Baldwin/
2 GIVN David
2 _MARNM Baldwin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1733
2 ADDR
3 CITY Spencer
3 STAE MA
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1818
2 ADDR
3 CITY Smithfield
3 STAE NY
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} DAVID5, David4, Joseph3, Joseph2, Joseph1
2 CONT
2 CONT David Baldwin, son of David Baldwin and Abigail Burr, was b. in Spencer, Mass., about 1733, it is said; settled in Smithfield, NY., and d. there about 1818, aged 80 to 90; he had lost one leg.
2 CONT
2 CONT He m., accourding to Draper's "History of Spencer," SIBBILAH WHITE, dau. John White, Sen., June 8,1763. By tradition, it is said, he m. his wife in Ashfield, Mass.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: John (c1760), Jonathan, and David. And, according to the Worcester, Mss., several daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT *It is noted that the given date of marriage and the birth of son John do not compute...BUT..CC Baldwin DOES qualify and says 'perhaps later'
2 CONT
2 CONT *The Baldwin genealogy from 1500 to 1881 (1881)
