1 NAME Jonathan /Baldwin/ Esq.
2 GIVN Jonathan
2 SURN Baldwin
2 NSFX Esq.
2 _MARNM Baldwin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1742
2 ADDR
3 CITY Spencer
3 STAE Province of Massachusetts
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 SEP 1788
2 ADDR
3 CITY Spencer
3 STAE Massachusetts
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} JONATHAN5, David4, Joseph3, Joseph2, Joseph1
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Baldwin, son of David Baldwin and Abigail Burr, was born in Spencer, Mass., in 1742 or 1743; he lived in Templeton (formerly Spencer). He m., Dec 28,1877, MARY HUNT, of Oxford, sister to the wife of Gen Larned, of Oxford;
2 CONC  she died Oct 8,1780, aged 36, and he m 2nd Nov 23,1782, SARAH BEMIS, dau of Capt William Bemis, of Spencer. He was a Justice of the Peace. He d. September,1788, and his widow m Robert Nichols, who d. in Barre, Vt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by Mary were: Eden (1768), Polly (1769), Nabby (1771), one that d. (1773), Jonathan (1774), Betsey (1777), and Asa (1780).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children by Sarah were: Sarah (1786), and Lucy (1788)
2 CONT
2 CONT The widow's thirds were divided May 17,1798.
2 CONT
