2 CONT According to family trees, Betsy is the daughter of Peter Stillson and Ruth Hanel. These trees also report she was born 13 Feb 1794. The cemetery transcription records her birth year as 1791. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Vital records of Richmond, Massachusetts, to the year 1850 (1913) page 66 & 78 records a marriage between Ruth HAND and Peter STILLSON 10 Oct 1787. (https://archive.org)
