1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=8251340 Find a Grave]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Oct. 29, 1787 Lee Berkshire County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 	Aug., 1846 Union County Iowa, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT This name is listed on a "monument erected AD 1888, in memory of those members of the Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints who died in 1846, 1847, and 1848, during their exodus to seek a home beyond the Rocky Mountains."
2 CONT
2 CONT Sally Hulet Whiting was born 29 Oct 1787 to Sylvanus Hulet and Mary Lewis. She married Elisha Whiting (Jr.) 18 Sep 1805 in Lee, Berkshire, Mass. They were the parents of 12 children. She died Aug 1846 in Mt. Pisgah, Union, Iowa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT *Sylvanus Hulet (1758 - 1824)
2 CONT *Mary Lewis Hulet (1763 - 1835)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT *Elisha Whiting (1785 - 1848)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT *Edwin Whiting (1809 - 1890)*
2 CONT *Catherine Louisa Whiting Talcott (1813 - 1900)*
2 CONT *Emeline Sally Whiting Cox (1817 - 1896)*
2 CONT *Chauncey Whiting (1819 - 1902)*
2 CONT *Sylvester Whiting (1827 - 1915)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Siblings:
2 CONT *Sally Hulet Whiting (1787 - 1846)
2 CONT *Charles Hulet (1790 - 1863)*
2 CONT *Charlotte Hulet Hubbard (1792 - 1838)*
2 CONT *Rhoda Hulet Mills (1795 - 1837)*
2 CONT *Tryphena Hulet Tillotson (1797 - 1829)*
2 CONT *Jonathan Hulet (1798 - ____)*
2 CONT *Sylvester Hulet (1800 - 1885)*
2 CONT *Francis Hulet (1802 - 1882)*
2 CONT *Mary Smith Hulet West (1804 - 1831)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Mount Pisgah Cemetery  Thayer Union County Iowa, USA
2 CONT
