1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The caption on this photo from Find A Grave.com, reads as follows:  John and second wife Elsie Emergene Shurtliff Burrup with their family, circa 1901.  They lived in Grant Ward, near Downey, Idaho.  Front:  James 
2 CONC Estle Burrup (holding hat).  Second row, L-R, Irvin Myrl and (baby) Sarah Lovina Burrup (later Waddoups).  Third row, L-R:  John Lowell, John (father), and Elsie Engergene "Ella" (mother).  Back:  Mary Elizabeth Burrup (later Fox)
2 CONC , daughter of first wife, Mary Elizabeth Quigley, who died shortly after the baby's birth in 1886.
