1 DEAT
2 DATE 8 AUG 1868
2 ADDR
3 CITY Millcreek
3 STAE Utah
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} (son of Vincent Shurtleff and Elizabeth Loomis). Born 1839, Westfield, Massachusetts. Came to Utah 1847, Jacob Foutz company.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:	Mary Ann Tribe 1868, Salt Lake City (daughter of George Tribe and Sarah Ann Mates of Ogden), who was born August 24, 1842.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children:
2 CONT
2 CONT             Annie, married Edwin Williams;
2 CONT             Lettie, married John Douglas;
2 CONT             Emerson, married Ida Burton;
2 CONT             Sarah Elizabeth, died aged 6. Family home Salt Lake City.
2 CONT
2 CONT Freighter. Died August 16, 1868, Salt Lake City.
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT *[http://history.lds.org/overlandtravels/searchPage Mormon Pioneer Overland Travel] Shurtleff, Emerson Davis; Edward Hunter - Jacob Foutz Company (1847); male, Age 8; Birth Date: 29 Jul 1839; Death Date: 8 Aug. 1868.
2 CONT *[http://archive.org/stream/pioneersprominen02essh#page/1160/mode/1up Pioneers and Prominent Men of Utah, page 1160]
