1 NAME Harrison Tuttle /Shurtleff/
2 GIVN Harrison Tuttle
2 SURN Shurtleff
2 _MARNM Shurtleff
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 JAN 1841
2 ADDR
3 CITY Russell
