2 CONT [https://worldcat.org/identities/lccn-nr95006223/ Palmer, Charles T. H. (Charles Theodore Hart) 1827-1897]
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Theodore Hart Palmer was born in Stonington, New London County, Connecticut on January 15,1827
2 CONT
2 CONT He studied at Yale University before soon moving to California where he continued to practice law in San Francisco where he was involved in many business interests and had many ups and downs, but continued to try. He later moved t
2 CONC o Sacramento where he established the first school in that city.
2 CONT
2 CONT Palmer was an early resident of San Francisco and Berkeley, California. He served as one of the first trustee of Folsom Prison.
2 CONT
