1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Grace Day (Wakefield)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT DAR ID Number: 14687 
2 CONT Born in Massachusetts
2 CONT Wife of Clinton Day
2 CONT Descendant of Corporal Elias Hemingway of Massachusetts 
2 CONT Daughter of Enoch Hemingway Wakefield and Caroline Huldah Wakefield, his wife 
2 CONT Granddaughter of James Wakefield and Hannah Hemingway, his wife 
2 CONT Gr.-granddaughter of Elias Hemingway and Mollie Patterson, his wife 
2 CONT Elias Hemingway, (1758-1835), enlisted as a private and was at Roxbury, 1776, in Captain Simon Edgel's Company and subsequently served under Captain Caleb Brooks and Colonel Nicholas Dike. He served four enlistments and was Corpor
2 CONC al, 1780, at the Rhode Island Alarm. 
2 CONT He was born at Framingham, Massachusetts and died at Roxbury, New Hampshire.
