2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of George
2 CONT When George Durant was born on 10 January 1631, in Surrey, England, his father, Thomas Durant, was 49 and his mother, Katherine Brigges, was 47. He had at least 2 sons and 4 daughters with Elizabeth Marwood. He died on 15 June 168
2 CONC 7, in Lyme, New London, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 56.
2 CONT
