2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth
2 CONT Elizabeth Marwood was born about 1636, in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut, United States. She had at least 2 sons and 4 daughters with George Durant. She died in February 1691, in her hometown, at the age of 56.
