2 CONT Edward Durant (abt. 1661 - abt. 1718)
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Durant
2 CONT Born about 2 Jun 1661 in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticutmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of George Durant Sr and Elizabeth (Unknown) Durant
2 CONT Brother of John Blake Jr. [half], Abigail (Durant) Tinker, Sarah (Durant) Tinker and Elizabeth (Durant) Wade
2 CONT Husband of Ann (Hall) Durant — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Elizabeth (Durant) Wade, Samuel Durant, Edward Durant and Ebenezer Durant
2 CONT Died about 28 Mar 1718 at about age 56 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile managers: Terri Davis private message [send private message] and Joan Prout private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 22 Sep 2024 | Created 18 Jun 2019
2 CONT This page has been accessed 369 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Durant b 2 June 1661 was the son of George & Elizabeth (Blake) Durant. [1] Note: also probably sourced from North American Family Histories.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Edward Durant, son of George who d 1687, the birth entry shows 2 June 1771 (not 1661) (perhaps a typo) in Middletown Vital Records 1651-1854 CT Town Birth Records, [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth ? death at age 66 in 1718 suggests he was b. abt. 1652.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married first Ann Hall in 1684 at Middletown, Middlesex, CT - their children were Elizabeth, Samuel, Edward II, John & Abigail Durant. [citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Marriage 1692 to Ann Hall and both their births as 1661. [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT After the death of Ann he married Sarah Whale on 2 Jun 1714 by Mr. Thomas Bodge in Boston, MA - they are parents of George Durant. [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Durant died 28 March 1718 in Boston, MA. Age given as 66 years. Buried 30th in Old Sexton Mills. [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT North America, Family Histories, 1500-2000 for Edward Durant[6]
