2 CONC m Collyar and William Thomas, gent. assistants, confessed. George Way and the two women were "sent from constable to constable to the place from which they came, which is a placed called Winter Harbor, near Richmans Island to the 
2 CONC Eastward." Thomas Wallen and Richard Carle were committed to ward.
