1 NOTE George Way of Lyme sold in New London, land on the west side of Newstreet between the land of his brother Thomas Way and Thomas Crocker. He also sold an addition of 12 acres below Newstreete called the hopyard. This lot was bounde
2 CONC d westerly by Newstreete, southerly by land of Brother Thomas Way, easterly by a brook of water, and northly by land of Thomas Crocker.
