2 CONT #John born 30 April 1698 in New London
2 CONT # David Born 20 June 1700 in New London
2 CONT #May born 15 May 1702 in New London
2 CONT #James Born 3 October 1703 in New London
2 CONT #Hannah born 8 January 1708/9 in new London
2 CONT #Ann born 28 January 1713/4 in New London
2 CONT
2 CONT Deposition of Thomas Way, Boston mariner, in re Capt. Kidd Sept 20, 1699Thomas Way mariner of Boston about some goods put on board his sloop by Capt Kidd and delivered to him in Boston Signed Thomas Way Endorsed Reed Sep 20 Read O
2 CONC ct 8 1699 Copy 1 p. [https://books.google.com/books?id=tGczAQAAMAAJ&pg=PA374&dq=capt,+way,++mariner+of+Boston&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwiLkcCV3pLdAhXo6oMKHcSlCuAQ6AEICTAA]
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Way, Grandson of the Now wife of John Smith to inherit Sept 1679 • New London, New London Co., CTAfter her death, Thomas Way, her grandson, was tohave several lots of land, including the Lester lot and the old House upon it
2 CONC .
