2 CONT * A Modern history of New London County, Connecticut pg 779*≤span id='Caulkins'>Caulkins: ≤/span>[[Caulkins-85|Caulkins, Frances Manwaring]]. ''[[Space:History of New London, Connecticut From the First Survey of the Coast in 1612|
2 CONC History of New London, Connecticut Fromthe First Survey of the Coast in 1612]]'', The Author, New London, 1852. [https://archive.org/details/bub_gb_HgIPz4OPYNoC  On Archive.org]
