2 CONT According to Find A Grave
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT John was born in 1683. He was the son of [[Caulkins-5|David Caulkins]]and [[Bliss-172|Mary Bliss]].  He passed away about 1761.
2 CONT John Calkins wife was France Leach, 1691. Their son was Samuel Williams Calkins, born 1728, he married Elizabeth Avery, born 1733
2 CONT
