1 NAME Samuel H. /Mabee/
2 GIVN Samuel H.
2 _MARNM Mabee
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birth==
2 CONT Samuel H. Mabee was born about 1804 in Walsingham, Ontario, Canada to Rev. Simon Mabee and Abigail (Gustin) Mabee.
2 CONT ==Marriage==
2 CONT Samuel H. Mabee and Hannah "Annie" (Still) Mabee married around 1827 in Canada. Note: No sources found for the November 14, 1927 date.
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT # Simon Mabee 1827 - 1892
2 CONT # John G Mabee 1829 - 1909
2 CONT # Gabriel Mabee 1832 - 1874
2 CONT # Alfred E Mabee 1834 - 1911
2 CONT ==Immigration==
2 CONT Samuel H. Mabee moved to Effingham County, Illinois in the 1860's.[2]
2 CONT ==Death==
2 CONT Samuel H. Mabee passed away in April, 1872. The day of death varies. The place of death is probably Altamount, Effingham, Illinois, USA
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT * https://maybeesociety.org/MaySoc/g0/p44.htm#i1291
