1 NAME Hans Thomes /Bichler/
2 GIVN Hans Thomes
2 SURN Bichler
2 _MARNM Bigler
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1673
2 PLAC Leiterswiller
2 ADDR
3 CITY Hoffen
3 STAE Alsace-Champagne-Ardenne-Lorraine
3 POST 67250
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 FEB 1732
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ingolsheim
3 STAE Grand Est
3 CTRY France
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Life===
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Thomes Bichler came from a Protestant family.  He was likely born in either Bas-Rhin, France, or the Emmenthal Valley in Canton Bern, Switzerland, as were his siblings.  The family settled in Ingolsheim, Bas-Rhin, France.  Th
2 CONC ere, Thomes married Anna Maria Vogler, a native from the region, in Hunspach, on January 7, 1698.  The couple had four surviving children:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Hans Jacob, b. 1701
2 CONT * Hans Georg, b. February 10, 1703
2 CONT * Marcus, b. April 17, 1705
2 CONT * Hans Michel, b. December 03, 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomes died on February 9. 1732, in Ingolsheim, France.
2 CONT
