2 CONT Anna Maria Volger (b. 1680, d. 17 Apr 1745)
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Maria Volger (daughter of Jacob Vogeler and Unknown) was born 1680 in Ingolsheim, Bas-Rhin, Alsace, France, and died 17 Apr 1745 in , , , Germany. She married (1) Hans Jacob Bigler, son of Bigler. She married (2) Hans Thomas 
2 CONC Buchler on 1704 in Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Anna Maria Volger and Hans Thomas Buchler: Marriage: 1704, Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
