2 CONT Altoona, PA: Altoona Mirror, issue of Saturday, 29 September 1906, p. 1, col. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT MRS. MARY DELOZIER,
2 CONT
2 CONT Widow of Abraham Delozier, died at 3 o'clock this morning, after a long illness with stomach trouble, at her home at Brook's Mills, three miles from Roaring Spring. The deceased was aged about 65 years. Her husband died several ye
2 CONC ars ago. She is survived by six children, all residing in this county. Mrs. Delozier was a member of the Brethren church. The funeral will take place next Monday afternoon and interment will be made in the Vicksburg cemetery, near
2 CONC  Brook's Mills.
2 CONT ________________________________________________
