2 CONT Certificate of Death
2 CONT Place of Death:  Allegheny County, Borough of Bellevue
2 CONT Full Name:  MRS. CATHERINE R. DELOZIER
2 CONT Residence:  31 S. Bryant Street, Bellevue, Pa.
2 CONT Sex:  Female
2 CONT Color:  White
2 CONT Marital Status:  Widowed
2 CONT Wife of:  Joseph S. Delozier
2 CONT Date of Birth:  Dec. 29, 1843
