2 CONT Obituary clipping from Roudebush surname folder
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH FRANKLIN ROUDEBUSH.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services for Mr. Roudebush, whose death occurred at 6 a.m. Thursday in his home, Indiana, R.D. 4, will be conducted in Coral Lutheran Church, of which he was a member, at 3 p.m. Sunday. The Rev. C. Thornton Hays will officiate and
2 CONC  interment will be in the church cemetery. Friends are being received after 7 p.m. today in the home of a daughter, Mrs. Ross Laney, in Coral.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Roudebush was born June 20, 1855, in Sligo, Pa., and had been a resident of Indiana County for 43 years, previously residing in Gallitzin. He was in the employ of the Potter Coal & Coke Co. for several years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Roudebush died in 1926. Surviving with Mrs. Laney are the following other children:  Mrs. Ann Clawson of Indiana, Mrs. Alice [clipping stops here - ed.]
2 CONT
2 CONT [there is no date on the clipping - ed.]
