1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Sarah Ann (Deming) Bates''' was born on March 5, 1755 in Wethersfield, Hartford County, Connecticut Colony. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-42774333 Gamaliel Deming] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-63538942 Reb
2 CONC ecca (Kellogg) Deming]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married [https://www.geni.com/profile-63543859 Joseph Bates]. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-63545829 Harry Bates]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63538758 John Bates]; [https://www.ge
2 CONC ni.com/profile-63547366 Joseph Bates]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63546896 Buitewell Bates]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63536280 Theodocia (Bates) Noble]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in 1800. 
2 CONT ----
