1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Harriet Bates (Noble) Walton''' was born on February 10, 1860 in Salt Lake City, Salt Lake County, Utah, United States. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-85480750 Joseph Bates Noble] and [https://www.geni.com/profi
2 CONC le-63535442 Julia Rosetta Thurston]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harriet married [https://www.geni.com/profile-63548130 George Emanuel McKenna] on February 27, 1901 in Scofield, Utah. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-63538742 Nettie Melba McKenna]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harriet married [https://www.geni.com/profile-59185755 Andrew Jackson Walton] on July 6, 1874 in Salt Lake City, Utah. Together they had the following children: [https://www.geni.com/profile-34720775805 Estella (Walton) Carter]; [
2 CONC https://www.geni.com/profile-63544624 Andrew Jackson Walton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63540722 Caroline Rozalia Walton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63545859 Hattie Elizabeth Walton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63538092
2 CONC  William Danie Walton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63551062 Sarah Josephine Walton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63550618 Arthur Bates Walton]; [https://www.geni.com/profile-63549400 Charles Herbert Walton]; [https://www.geni
2 CONC .com/profile-63539125 Matilda Walton]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on April 4, 1930 in Los Angeles, Los Angeles County, California, United States. 
2 CONT ----
