2 CONT  Martha2 MARTIN (John1) was born in Dover, New Hampshire circa 1648. Martha died November 13, 1694 in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey at 46 years of age.(18) She was interred November 1694 in Piscataway, Middlesex County,
2 CONC  New Jersey.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John LANGSTAFF circa 1674 in Piscataway, New Jersey. John was born circa 1647 in Dover, New Hampshire. John died after 1706/7 in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha MARTIN and John LANGSTAFF had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT  22 i. Henry3 LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, New Jersey January 26, 1675/6.(19) Henry died February 4, 1675/6 in Piscataway, New Jersey at less than one year of age.(20) He was interred February 1675/6 in Piscataway, New Jersey
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT  23 ii. Lucilla LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, New Jersey July 17, 1677.(21)
2 CONT
2 CONT  24 iii. Mary LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, New Jersey December 15, 1679.(22) Mary died before 1689 in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey.
2 CONT
2 CONT  25 iv. John LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, New Jersey May 3, 1682.(23) John died May 30, 1682 in Piscataway, New Jersey at less than one year of age.(24) He was interred May 1682 in Piscataway, New Jersey.
2 CONT
2 CONT  26 v. Sarah LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey September 19, 1683.(25)
2 CONT
2 CONT  27 vi. Henry LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey August 22, 1686.(26)
2 CONT
2 CONT  28 vii. Mary LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey February 4, 1688/9.(27)
2 CONT
2 CONT  29 viii. John LANGSTAFF was born in Piscataway, Middlesex County, New Jersey August 6, 1691.(28)
2 CONT
2 CONT  + 30 ix. Priscilla LANGSTAFF was born August 18, 1694.
