2 CONT 6. Joseph4 Martin (John3, Isaac2, Christopher1) was born 1657 in Dover, New Hampshire, and died 1723 in
2 CONT
2 CONT Piscataway, NJ. He married Sarah Trotter November 25, 1679. She was born May 03, 1665 in Newbury, Mass,
2 CONT
2 CONT and died in Piscataway, NJ.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Joseph Martin and Sarah Trotter are:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 10 i. James5 Martin, born December 14, 1680 in Piscataway, NJ; died Abt. 1771 in Basking Ridge, NJ.
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 ii. Joseph Martin, born February 22, 1682/83. He married Susannah Auger September 01, 1707.
2 CONT
2 CONT 12 iii. Abigail Martin, born January 21, 1689/90; died January 19, 1692/93.
2 CONT
2 CONT 13 iv. David Martin, born July 08, 1696; died 1752. He married Elizabeth Doty March 09, 1713/14.
2 CONT
2 CONT 14 v. Joshua Martin, born November 21, 1698. He married Sarah Sopers April 06, 1715.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15 vi. Moses Martin, born February 19, 1699/00. He married Margaret Mack March 05, 1718/19.
2 CONT
