2 CONT SEVEN CHILDREN identified in sources. || Joseph Martin Sr. was born about 1657 in Dover, NH, the son of John Martin V and Esther Roberts. He married Sarah Trotter on 25 Nov 1679 in Woodbridge, NJ. They had 7 children: James, Josep
2 CONC h, Jr., Abigail, Peter, David, Joshua, and Moses. Martin died in 1723 in Piscataway, Middlesex, NJ.
