2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/proceedingsofnew04newj_0#page/36/mode/1up
2 CONT *MARRIAGES
2 CONT *Higgins, Rebecca (Rich. and Mary), to Thomas Martin,	Apl. 28, 1683.
2 CONT *https://archive.org/stream/proceedingsofnew04newj_0#page/38/mode/1up
