1 NAME Mary /Walker/
2 GIVN Mary
2 SURN Walker
2 _MARNM Drake
2 NICK Mary Ann Walker
2 NICK Levice
2 NICK Mary Ann Patience Walker
2 NICK Drake
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1625
2 ADDR
3 STAE New Hampshire
1 BURI
2 DATE 29 JUL 1688
2 PLAC Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 29 JUL 1688
