1 NOTE Great Bay is now Greenland. Francis Drake served on grand jury of Norfolk Co.
2 CONT in 1663 & he & Nathaniel Drake were sureyors of highways in 1663. In 1668
2 CONT Francis & Mary dispose of their Greenland property & within 2 yr. the family
2 CONT (5 in all) moved to Piscataway. Their only daughter was married there in Dec
2 CONT of 1670. In 1675, 300 acres were allotted to the family of 5. On 15 July
2 CONT 1675, Francis was made Captain of Twp Militia. In March 1677/8 200 acres were
2 CONT surveyed for him. Francis was also Justice of Peace & Judge of Co. in 1682.
