2 CONC , grandson, Francis Drake. Proved July 20, 1641." "Again, will of Augustine Drake, of Ide Co. of Devon, merchant, Nov. 6, 1644, names sons, Augustine, William, John, Robert, Richard, dau. Agnes Drake, et al. and "my son, Francis D
2 CONC rake" et al. Proved December 31, 1646." "This Francis Drake is possibly, or probably, the Francis who came to New England, was at Portsmouth, N.H. in 1631, (1641) and died in New Jersey 25 September 1687."
