2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT ===  Francis Drake, son of Robert Drake 1580 ===
2 CONT Francis Drake, son of Robert Drake 1580-1667, moved to Piscataway with his wife Mary (Walker) and three sons in 1668.  They moved in search of protection for his religious and property rights.  The Drakes became a leading family i
2 CONC n Piscataway and New Jersey. Francis Drake was a kinsman of the Great Elizabethan Admiral, Sir Francis Drake.  It's likely that Francis was the grandson of Sir Francis' brother Thomas.
2 CONT
