1 NOTE Hezekiah was the son of Nicholas Bonham & Hannah Fuller from Barnstable, Plymouth Colony. Hezekiah & Mary's children were all b. in Piscataway. Hezekiah went to Maidenhead (Old) Hunterdon Co., before 1712, where he married a 2nd t
2 CONC ime & had 15 children by his 2nd wife. "History of Piscataway 1666-1976" p 65 says "Hezekiah Bonham became a townsman in 1687.  About the year 1700 Hezekiah engaged in the dispute on Baptist doctrine with the Rev. Edmond Dunham..w
2 CONC as granted land in 1694.
