1 NAME Mary /Bonham/
2 GIVN Mary
2 SURN Bonham
2 _MARNM FitzRandolph
2 NICK Mary Bonham Fitz Randolph
2 NICK Mary Bonham
2 NICK FITZ-RANDOLPH
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 4 OCT 1691
2 ADDR
3 CITY Piscataway Township
3 STAE New Jersey
3 CTRY Colonial America
1 BURI
2 DATE FEB 1779
2 PLAC St. James Episcopal Church Cem., Edison, Middlesex, New Jersey USA
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 25 FEB 1779
2 ADDR
3 CITY Piscataway Township
3 STAE New Jersey
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mary is recognized by the Mayflower Society as a descendant of Edward Fuller of the Mayflower, thus making the descendants of Mary and Jonathan Fitz Randolph eligible to become members of the Society.
2 CONT *__________________
2 CONT
2 CONT *''''''The Descendants of Edward Fitz Randolph and Elizabeth Blossom 1630 - 1950
2 CONT *http://randolpharchives.org/books/Desc%20of%20Edward%20FitzRandolph%20and%20Elizabeth%20Blossom.pdf
2 CONT *8. THOMAS2 FITZ RANDOLPH (1), born Aug. 16, 1659 at Barnstable, Mass.; died in 1745 in Piscataway, N. J.; will dated July 24, 1745 and proved Oct. 25, 1745; mar. in Piscataway Nov. 23, 1686, ELIZABETH MANNING, born about 1669, di
2 CONC ed Mar. 1, 1731, aged 63, at Piscataway, int. St. James; dau. of Jeffrey and Hepzibah (Andrews) Manning. Thomas Fitz Randolph was a weaver.
2 CONT *Children, born in Piscataway:
2 CONT **''''''	30. JONATHAN3 FITZ RANDOLPH (8), born Piscataway Jan. 12, 1692/3; died there 1783; will dated Feb. 25, 1779, proved June 5, 1783; mar. 1715 MARY BONHAM, born Piscataway Oct. 4, 1691 [7], dau. of Hezekiah and Mary (Dunn) B
2 CONC onham. Three youngest children probably by second wife.
2 CONT **Children, born at Piscataway:
2 CONT ***		i. ABEL, b. Sept. 1, 1716. No further record.
2 CONT ***		78. ii. MALIACHI, b. Apr. 5, 1718.
2 CONT ***		79. iii. KEZIAH, b. June 18, 1720.
2 CONT ***		80. iv. JONATHAN, b. Oct. 22, 1722.
2 CONT ***		v. LAWRENCE, b. June 3, 1725. No further record.
2 CONT ***		vi. HUGH, b. June 22, 1727. No further record.
2 CONT ***		vii. MARTHA, b. May 25, 1729. No further record.
2 CONT ***		viii. ELIZABETH, b. Nov. 18, 1731. No further record.
2 CONT ***		ix. MARY, b. Apr. 3, 1734.
2 CONT ***		x. SAMUEL, b. Oct., 1738.
2 CONT ***		xi. PHINEAS, prob. b. 1742. Mentioned in father's will, 1779. (See No. 120).
2 CONT ***		xii. SUSANNAH. Mentioned in will as widow of PATRICK BOYDE.
2 CONT *_________________
2 CONT
2 CONT Information Sources: 1.  Piscataway NJ Vital Records.
2 CONT
