1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''https://www.familysearch.org/en/tree/person/about/LDHM-4FC
2 CONT Brief Life History of John'''
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Runyon Jr was born on 18 November 1695, in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey, British Colonial America, his father, John Runyon, was 26 and his mother, Elizabeth Dunn, was 21. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Ann Elizabeth Freeman in 1715, in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in October 1748, in Rocky Hill, Somerset, New Jersey, British Colonial America, at the age of 52.
