2 CONT (2) William Fish, who died soon & then Mary immediatly married (3) Joseph
2 CONT Furman. When Fish died, 1747, of Somerset Co., leaving a will, he named wife,
2 CONT Mary & a witness was Hannah Runyon wife of Benjamin's brother Samuel. It also
2 CONT said Benjamin lived in Stoney Brook, joining Henry Freeman (who was his
2 CONT brother John's, father in law). In information I copied from Pascataway
2 CONT Library, said Benjamin son of John & listed his children & wife & his dates.
