2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Thomas
2 CONT
2 CONT When Thomas Runyan was born about 1673, in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey, British Colonial America, his father, Vincent Runyon-Rongnion, was 30 and his mother, Ann Martha Boutcher, was 25.
2 CONT
2 CONT  He married Martha Dunn about 1698, in Piscataway, Middlesex, New Jersey, United States. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 3 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 16 April 1753, in Hopewell Township, Hunterdon, New Jersey, British Colonial America, at the age of 81, and was buried in Hopewell Baptist Meeting House Cemetery
