2 CONT Marie Wright & Harman Clark both say this Peter who md Catherine Quick is the
2 CONT son of Peter (2208) & Providence Blackford. M C Shepherd also says Thomas did
2 CONT not have children Ann, John, Samuel, Benjamin, Elizabeth & Reuben.
2 CONT Carolyn has Reune b. 1675, could this be Thomas Reune?
