2 CONC Marie Wright & Harman Clark both say this Peter who md Catherine Quick is the son of Peter (2208) & Providence Blackford. M C Shepherd also says Thomas did not have children Ann, John, Samuel, Benjamin, Elizabeth & Reuben. Carolyn
