2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Benajah was born in 1720. He was the son of Joseph Dunn and Hannah Drake. He passed away in 1781.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Will
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Name of God Amen I Benajah Dunn of Mononghelah County in Province of Virginia being Weak in body but Perfect Mind & Memory, Calling to Mind the Mortality of myBody it is apointed oncefor man to dye I Commit my Body to the d
2 CONC ust to be buried in a Decent Manner, at the Discresion of my Executors, Committing my spirit to god that gave it & C -­ First I give & Bequeath to my Well Beloved Wife, The Choice of my Cowes & a Perticular Brown heafer out of my 
2 CONC stock & a small Black mare Named May & Seven of the Best Hoggs out of my stock &four acres of Wheat Now in the ground, & A Plenty of Grain Now in the Barn and Cribs & one years provision out of my estate & I alow her to Live on th
2 CONC is my Plantation Enduring her Natural Life & the WholeBenefits of sd place to be for her use & Likewiseall the Householdfurniture &C & at her Decease I give & bequeath to my Grandson Zephaniah Dunns oldest son Benajah Dunn this my
2 CONC  Track of Land Which I now Live upon &C - & the Rest of my Moveable Estate to be Made Publick sale of Rye & Wheat Cowes and Horses &g by my Executors with Which I do allow all my Lawful Debts to be paid. & Whatever Remains of What
2 CONC  is Exposed to Publick Sale, When all Collected & all Debts Discharged I give & Bequeath to my WellBeloved Wifeone third part of that Cash if any Remains, . & I give & Bequeath to myDaughter Elisabeth Dunn the other twoparts of sd
2 CONC  Cash if there should any Remain And I make & ordain Levi herrod & Joseph Mills my sole Executors of this myLast Will & testamentfor the Intent &purposes in this my Will Containd, & I make my Loving friends &g overseers of this my
2 CONC  last Will to take Care & see the same performd, According to my true Intent & meaning &C -­ In Witness Whereof I the Said Benajah Dunn have to this Last Will & Testament set my hand & seal this Nineteenth Day of February in the y
2 CONC ear of our Lord one thousand SevenHundred & Eighty one I 781 Benajah Dun Seald Signed in the Presance of us Michail Mills, Benjamin Levi, Benjamin Davis [1]
2 CONT
