2 CONC x County, Province of New Jersey   Immediate Family: Daughter of Nicholas Bonham and Hannah Bonham  Wife of John Fitzrandolph  Mother of Sarah Smalley; Elizabeth Randolph; Temperance Martin; Francis Fitzrandolph; John Fitzrandolph
