1 NOTE Jonathan may have been born in 1688. He was the son of Benjamin Martin and Margaret Alston. Martha was his second wife. Jonathan's will dated 4 May 1768 proved 17 Aug 1768 states he is of Piscataway, mentioned some grandchildren. 
2 CONC Elizabeth Hayden, dau of John Sutton; Prudence, dau of Joseph Howard, daus Martha, Anne, Elizabeth, Rachel, Catherine & Sarah, son in law Daniel Dunham, son Peter; grandsons John Martin & Jonathan Martin.
