1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Died about 1799. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married March 29, 1744 in Piscataway Middlesex County, New Jersey. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her and her husband had a total of eight children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Is said she survived her husband and continued to live on the Dunn Family Farm up until the year 1799.
2 CONT
2 CONT Has been said there is an Old Dunn Burial Grounds, Girards Fort and Muddy Creek - Washington County, Pennsylvania. 
2 CONT
