1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Married on Sept. 18, 1828, and bore at least 5 children:  John Budd DUNHAM (1829-1903);  Mary Ann Dunham BALLARD (1832-1916); Eunice Dunham DALE (1834-1933); Franklin DUNHAM (c.1839 – before 1850);  and Elizabeth D
2 CONC unham PLATTER (1843 – before 1930).
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza's paternal ancestry is:
2 CONT
2 CONT John BUDD (1785 – 1863, m’d Eunice Riggs [1785 – 1853]), son of
2 CONT William BUDD (1755 – 1805, m’d Sichy Scofield), son of 
2 CONT Daniel BUDD (1722 – 1806, m’d Mary Purdy [1728 – 1801]), son of
2 CONT John BUDD (1697 – 1756, m’d Mary Prudence Strang [1695/99 – 1745/54]), son of
2 CONT Capt. Joseph BUDD (1669 – 1722, m’d Sarah Underhill [1678 – 1755]), son of
2 CONT John BUDD (1625 – 1684, m’d Mary Horton), son of
2 CONT Lt. John BUDD (1599 – 1669) & Katherine Browne (1591 – 1674), from England
2 CONT
2 CONT Eliza's maternal ancestry is:
2 CONT Eunice Riggs (1785-1853, m’d John BUDD [1785-1863]), daughter of
2 CONT Jonathan RIGGS (1745-1836, m’d Mary Hampton [1745-1791]), son of
2 CONT Thomas RIGGS (1692-1789, m’d Eunice Morris [1703-1789]), son of
2 CONT Edward RIGGS (1640-1696, m’d Mary Munn [1640-1685]), son of
2 CONT Edward RIGGS (1618-1669, m’d Elizabeth Roosa [1617-1680]), son of
