2 CONC cres (surveyed 7 March 1774 as 328 acres) to be called "Strelitz" and on 20 March 1788 a 3rd. warrant was granted to Dewalt for 343 acres, which was called "Mechlinburg". Also on 25 August 1785, together with Ludwick Otterman, Dew
2 CONC alt purchased 302 and a half acres, located on Pokes Run. This property was called Macklin`s Retreat.
2 CONT
