1 NAME Richard Coulter /Drum/
2 GIVN Richard Coulter
2 SURN Drum
2 _MARNM Drum
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 MAY 1825
2 PLAC Greensburg, Westmoreland County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE AFT 15 OCT 1909
