1 NOTE Joseph Ekas obituary: Butler Citizen dated 5-20-1915.
2 CONT Joseph Ekis aged 80, a well known and respected resident of Washington Township died Wednesday morning at the home of his daughter, Mrs. Eli Gibson of Parsonville. Death was due to infirmities of age. The funeral will be held Frid
2 CONC ay from the residence, with interment at Highland Cemetery, North Washington. Was a Civil War vet, Company H, 102 Pennsylvania Infantry. GAR. [From 1883 Butler County History, page 105: "Corp. Joseph EKIS, m. Oct. 18, 1864; absent
2 CONC  with leave at muster out."]
