2 CONT War of 1812 veteran Capt., husband of Sarah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ashley married Sarah Lazarus on Dec 21 1819 in Portage County, Ohio. They had four children.
2 CONT
2 CONT "In 1818 he emigrated to Deerfield,O,making the entire journey in a sleigh during the month of March,and traveling from Buffalo to Painsville on the ice of Lake Erie.This country was then in forest,and he cleared off his own farm 
2 CONC with the axe.In 1819 he married Miss Sarah Lazarus,and in 1826 he moved to Ravenna." from his obit
