1 CONT Genealogy of the Descendants of Thomas Lord
1 CONT
1 CONT Author: Kenneth Lord
1 CONT
1 CONT Call Number: R929.2 qL867L
1 CONT
1 CONT Thomas Lord was an original proprietor and founder of Hartford, Conn., in 1636.
1 CONT
1 CONT Bibliographic Information: Lord, Kenneth. Genealogy of the Descendants of Thomas Lord. New Haven, Conn.: The Tuttle, Morehouse & Taylor Co., 1946.
1 CONT
