0 @N6000000002339104850@ NOTE When her mother died in 1891, sisteen year old Maude went to New York tolive with an uncle.  There she became a registered nurse.  During her nurseing career she preerred working with obstetric patients.  She worked in Bellevue Ho
1 CONC spital in New York City and took care of wealthy pregnant women as a private nurse at times.  She hated alcohol and was highly allergic to tobacco smoke and ground pepper.
