1 CONT DESCENDANTS IN THE LINE OF HANNAH INGERSOLL,
1 CONT DAUGHTER OF JOHN INGERSOLL, THE SETTLER.
1 CONT THIRD GENERATION.
1 CONT I.
1 CONT HANNAH INGERSOLL was married to Stephen Kelsey, of Hartford, Conn., November 15, 1672. He was son of William Kelsey, one of the first settlers of Hartford, and was baptized November 7, 1647.
1 CONT Mr. Stephen Kelsey died November 30, 1710, aged 63.
1 CONT His widow, Mrs. Hannah Kelsey, died (???).
1 CONT Children.
1 CONT 16 Hannah,       born                    1675.
1 CONT 17 Stephen,      born September      20, 1677.
1 CONT 18 John,         born January        20, 1680.
1 CONT 19 Daniel,       born September      14, 1682.
1 CONT 20 William,      born February       19, 1685.
1 CONT 21 James,        born August         21, 1687.
1 CONT 22 Charles,      born June           15, 1692.  Settled in Hartford. Died July 1, 1777,
1 CONT aged 85.
1 CONT
1 CONT DESCENDANTS IN THE LINE OF DORATHY INGERSOLL,
1 CONT DAUGHTER OF JOHN INGERSOLL, THE SETTLER.
1 CONT THIRD GENERATION.
1 CONT II.
1 CONT DORATHY INGERSOLL was twice married. 1. To Jacob Phelps, of Westfield, Mass., May 2, 1672. He was son of George Phelps, of Windsor, Conn., afterwards of Westfield, and of Frances his second wife, widow of Thomas Dewey, and was bor
1 CONC n February 7, 1649. He died October 6, 1689, in the 41st year of his age. 2. To (???) Root.
1 CONT
1 CONT Mrs. Dorathy Root, alias Phelps, died (???).
1 CONT
1 CONT Mr. (???) Root died (???).
1 CONT
1 CONT Children,--by her first husband.
1 CONT 23 Dorathy,      born December       18, 1673.  Died February 2, 1674.
1 CONT 24 Dorathy,      born May            10, 1675.  Married Edward Kibbe, of Enfield,
1 CONT Conn., November 30, 1693.
1 CONT 25 Hannah,       born November       26, 1677.  Married John Kibbe.
1 CONT 26 Israel,       born April           3, 1681.
1 CONT 27 Benjamin,     born January         8, 1683.
1 CONT 28 Joseph,       born August          5, 1686.
1 CONT 29 Jedediah,     born December        7, 1688.
1 CONT
1 CONT Children,--by her second husband. Supposed,--none.
