0 @N6000000000250111338@ NOTE An error in entering the births of Marvilla and her older brother Si meon in the Chesterfield vital records has caused them to be indexed unde r Haden instead of Litchfield.  As a result, the birth dates given for th ese first two
1 CONC  children are frequently incomplete or incorrect in publishe d materials.  The most common incorrect date given for Marvilla is 2 Octo ber 1802, but the Chesterfield record shows the correct date is 16 Octobe r 1802.
1 CONT      Daughter Marville Riggs received five dollars in the will of Ensig n Litchfield dated 1 October 1840, "if called for".  Marvillee and Amas a had remained in Massachusetts when the rest of the family removed to El licottville.
1 CONT      "Families of Chesterfield" says "in 1854 they [Marvilla & Albert Nob le] were residents of Salt Lake Valley, Utah."  The date and place of he r death have not been found.
0 @N6000000000250111369@ NOTE A family group sheet prepared by Aldyth (Pierce) Glenn, taken from T emple records, shows his birth place as Blandford MA; The Shurtleff genea logy gives it as Chester MA, and says Azial and Emeline's first three chi ldren were bo
1 CONC rn in Massachusetts, and the rest in Utah.
0 @N6000000000250111389@ NOTE A family group sheet prepared by Aldyth (Pierce) Glenn, taken from T emple records, shows her birth place as Blandford MA.
1 CONT
1 CONT Census:
