1 CONT  1860, Tooele, UT, in the household of Albert W. Noble: Maria Noble, ag e 30, born in MA
0 @N6000000000250111354@ NOTE A family group sheet prepared by Aldyth (Pierce) Glenn, taken from T emple records, incorrectly gives her birth place as "Chester MA" .
