1 CONT 1855, Ellicottville, NY: Melensa age 50, wife of John Riggs Jr., b. MA, r esident 21 years.
1 CONT 1860, Ellicottville, NY: Melinza, age 52, born in Massachusetts, in the h ousehold of Alvin Riggs.
1 CONT 1870, Ellicottville, NY: Melenza Riggs, age 65, born in Massachusetts, i n the household of Alvin Riggs.
