1 CONT Ulrich arrived in Philadelphia on October 30, 1738, from Rotterdam by way of Cowes on Ship "Elizabeth" with 64 Palatines aboard and sailing under Capt. Hodgson.
1 CONT
1 CONT On May 5, 1738, Johannes Michael Emmert, Mayor of the German City in the Palatinate gave his certificate for Ulrich to go to Pennsylvania.
