1 CONT Came to New England with his family in 1640 and owned land in Portsmouth NH in 1654 and served as a juror in in 1660.
1 CONT Moved to the two year old town of Piscataway NJ in 1660. Francis served as the Captain of the Militia from 15 Jul 1675 to 30 May 1678. He was one of the first selectman of Piscataway, a constable, justice of the Peace, and in 1682
1 CONC  he became a county judge.
1 CONT Not in his father's will probably because of religious differences.
