1 CONT Beginnings of Three New Jersey Family Lines" p 18 says in 1652 Francis , Mary
1 CONT (his wife) & probably 1 child were living in Strawberry Bank on western side
1 CONT of Piscataqua River (the stream that now divides New Hampshire from Maine).
1 CONT Strawberry Bank was changed to Portsmouth about 1653. On 17 Apr 1654, the
1 CONT town assigned to Francis a house lot on Noble's Island (now northern part of
1 CONT Portsmouth) & in July 1655 he obtained another house & lot S of Great Bay.
