1 CONT Note:
1 CONT !THE STOCKTON PROJECT, Pam Jeglinski; FEB 2000
1 CONT !LOUISE THIESSEN, "KENWORTHYS MARRY", 1990, PG 206; birth has been placed 1605 to as late as 1635.; lived Portsmouth, Rockingham, RI. Baptists were not tolerated in NH. The Gov of NJ invited the Baptists to move there which they d
1 CONC id, about 1668. Francis was left out of his father's will, probably because he was a Baptist. Francis was Capt of Foot in 1664; received grants of land on Raritan River; he received license to keep a Tavern in Piscataway 5 JUL 167
1 CONC 3
