1 CONT
1 CONT ID: I1893
1 CONT Name: Francis DRAKE
1 CONT Sex: M
1 CONT Birth: ABT. 1618 in England
1 CONT Death: AFT. 1687 in Middlesex County, New Jersey
1 CONT Note:
1 CONT Notes from Barbara Denahey: The earliest Drake ancestor identified is Captain Francis Drake. He was born about 1618 probably in Devonshire, England. He apparently immigrated to Portsmouth, New Hampshire by 1635. He later lived in 
1 CONC Piscataway, New Jersey. His will was dated 29 Sep 1667 and was recorded in Middlesex County, New Jersey. He married Mary Walker.
1 CONT New Jersey Archives Vol 21 p. 35
1 CONT New Jersey Colonial Documents East Jersey Deeds, etc., Liber No 3
1 CONT 1673 July 15 License to keep an Ordinary at New Piscataway, granted to Francis Drake.
1 CONT p. 36
1 CONT 1674 Dec 11 Orders: Thomas Johnson to be sworn in as Constable of Newark, John Woodroff as Constable of Elizabeth town, John Blumfield for Woodbridge, Francis Drake for New Piscataway...
1 CONT pp. 37-38
1 CONT 1675 July 15. Commission for the Bergen Company vizt...for the New Piscataway Compy vizt
1 CONT Francis Drake Captain (discharged at his own request May 30, 1678)...
1 CONT ===================================
