0 @N6000000000604990488@ NOTE SOLOMAN2 SAYLOR (JOSEPH1) was born 1760 in Sniders Creek, Mecklenburg County, North Carolina, and died November 1848 in Cumberland River, Harlan County, Kentucky. He married (1) HANNAH UNKNOWN Bef. 1790. She was born 1770 in North
1 CONC  Carolina. He married (2) SARAH SALYER Bef. 1798, daughter of ZACHARIAH SALYER and ELIZABETH DUNN. She was born 1770 in Rutherford County, North Carolina, and died 1850 in Cumberland River, Harlan County, Kentucky
